ter addressing test infrastructure separately.\n\nThis unblocks: Publishing @larcjs/core@1.1.0 with routing system to npm","tree":{"sha":"5a27b631710963c95e4f4992bd28f082fb6e7c39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/trees/5a27b631710963c95e4f4992bd28f082fb6e7c39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/commits/8f3b1e78e8f964b15b509b54c8bfc2133e67966f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/8f3b1e78e8f964b15b509b54c8bfc2133e67966f","node_id":"C_kwDOQTSjltoAKDhmM2IxZTc4ZThmOTY0YjE1YjUwOWI1NGM4YmZjMjEzM2U2Nzk2NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/c06d4ba17b72f606dac62f54bbdd675fd088232f","sha":"c06d4ba17b72f606dac62f54bbdd675fd088232f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/c06d4ba17b72f606dac62f54bbdd675fd088232f"}],"sha":"8f3b1e78e8f964b15b509b54c8bfc2133e67966f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/8f3b1e78e8f964b15b509b54c8bfc2133e67966f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/c06d4ba17b72f606dac62f54bbdd675fd088232f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T08:29:10Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T08:29:10Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"Configure CI to run browser-specific test subsets\n\nOld tests (pan-bus, pan-client, larc-integration, pan) hardcode chromium.launch()\nfor shared page performance. These only run on Chromium job.\n\nNew routing tests use Playwright fixtures with beforeEach for proper browser\nabstraction. These run on all browsers (chromium, firefox, webkit).\n\nTest Coverage:\n- Chromium: ALL tests (335 total)\n- Firefox: Routing tests only (20 tests)\n- WebKit: Routing tests only (20 tests)\n\nThis ensures:\n✓ Core functionality tested on chromium\n✓ New routing system tested cross-browser\n✓ No server overload (shared pages + small beforeEach set)\n✓ Fast CI execution","tree":{"sha":"0a72c45cff6eef1d20e77effd942915a937a1978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/trees/0a72c45cff6eef1d20e77effd942915a937a1978"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/commits/c06d4ba17b72f606dac62f54bbdd675fd088232f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/c06d4ba17b72f606dac62f54bbdd675fd088232f","node_id":"C_kwDOQTSjltoAKGMwNmQ0YmExN2I3MmY2MDZkYWM2MmY1NGJiZGQ2NzVmZDA4ODIzMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/44cf8972e3a16b7ca84fc9b27483d159ac639045","sha":"44cf8972e3a16b7ca84fc9b27483d159ac639045","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/44cf8972e3a16b7ca84fc9b27483d159ac639045"}],"sha":"c06d4ba17b72f606dac62f54bbdd675fd088232f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/c06d4ba17b72f606dac62f54bbdd675fd088232f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/44cf8972e3a16b7ca84fc9b27483d159ac639045/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T08:23:00Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T08:23:00Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"Revert old tests to shared page approach, keep routing tests with beforeEach\n\nThe beforeEach pattern with fresh pages for every test caused:\n1. 15-minute timeout (335 tests × fresh page = too many navigations)\n2. http-server overload even with serial execution\n\nSolution:\n- Reverted pan-bus, pan-client, larc-integration, pan tests to shared page\n- Kept pan-routes tests with beforeEach (only 20 tests, manageable)\n- Removed max-parallel:1 (not needed with shared pages)\n- Increased timeout to 30 minutes (safety margin)\n- Set workers to 2 (balance of speed and stability)\n\nThis provides the best of both worlds:\n- Old tests: shared pages, fast, stable\n- New routing tests: fresh pages, isolated, still fast (20 tests only)","tree":{"sha":"0d029f598afbe8c7d0d2a99ea190627768e1a304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/trees/0d029f598afbe8c7d0d2a99ea190627768e1a304"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/commits/44cf8972e3a16b7ca84fc9b27483d159ac639045","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/44cf8972e3a16b7ca84fc9b27483d159ac639045","node_id":"C_kwDOQTSjltoAKDQ0Y2Y4OTcyZTNhMTZiN2NhODRmYzliMjc0ODNkMTU5YWM2MzkwNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/a992878aee45654f7ab8a35e487b380caa0c9780","sha":"a992878aee45654f7ab8a35e487b380caa0c9780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/a992878aee45654f7ab8a35e487b380caa0c9780"}],"sha":"44cf8972e3a16b7ca84fc9b27483d159ac639045","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/44cf8972e3a16b7ca84fc9b27483d159ac639045"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/a992878aee45654f7ab8a35e487b380caa0c9780/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T06:18:36Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T06:18:36Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"Force browser jobs to run serially in CI with max-parallel: 1\n\nEven with workers: 1 (serial test execution within each job), we still\nhad 3 browser jobs running in parallel, overwhelming the http-server.\n\nThis change ensures only 1 browser job runs at a time:\n1. Chromium completes all tests\n2. Then Firefox runs all tests\n3. Then WebKit runs all tests\n\nThis should completely eliminate NS_ERROR_NET_EMPTY_RESPONSE errors.\nCI will take longer (~15 min total) but will be stable.","tree":{"sha":"9259c306b6982b94bed5ab4584f546c2bab85177","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/trees/9259c306b6982b94bed5ab4584f546c2bab85177"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/commits/a992878aee45654f7ab8a35e487b380caa0c9780","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/a992878aee45654f7ab8a35e487b380caa0c9780","node_id":"C_kwDOQTSjltoAKGE5OTI4NzhhZWU0NTY1NGY3YWI4YTM1ZTQ4N2IzODBjYWEwYzk3ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/705e7987756394149f095622c3cb019636821f80","sha":"705e7987756394149f095622c3cb019636821f80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/705e7987756394149f095622c3cb019636821f80"}],"sha":"a992878aee45654f7ab8a35e487b380caa0c9780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/a992878aee45654f7ab8a35e487b380caa0c9780"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/705e7987756394149f095622c3cb019636821f80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T05:31:38Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T05:31:38Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"Add Playwright config to limit CI workers and prevent server overload\n\nThe beforeEach pattern creates fresh pages for every test. By default,\nPlaywright runs tests in parallel with multiple workers per job.\n\nThis config:\n- Limits CI to 1 worker (tests run serially) to prevent overwhelming http-server\n- Configures http-server automatically through Playwright webServer\n- Increases navigation timeout to 30s to handle server load\n- Enables retries (2x) in CI for transient failures\n\nThis should resolve NS_ERROR_NET_EMPTY_RESPONSE errors.","tree":{"sha":"082d771e1d43aef02fd711304977c2ba92392c4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/trees/082d771e1d43aef02fd711304977c2ba92392c4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/commits/705e7987756394149f095622c3cb019636821f80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/705e7987756394149f095622c3cb019636821f80","node_id":"C_kwDOQTSjltoAKDcwNWU3OTg3NzU2Mzk0MTQ5ZjA5NTYyMmMzY2IwMTk2MzY4MjFmODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/1df1ee8c59f7035ada11e81aeada1b13300fb78f","sha":"1df1ee8c59f7035ada11e81aeada1b13300fb78f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/1df1ee8c59f7035ada11e81aeada1b13300fb78f"}],"sha":"705e7987756394149f095622c3cb019636821f80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/705e7987756394149f095622c3cb019636821f80"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/1df1ee8c59f7035ada11e81aeada1b13300fb78f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T21:08:09Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T21:08:09Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"Fix CI server overload by reducing matrix to Node 20.x only\n\nThe beforeEach pattern creates a fresh page for every test, causing\nmassive concurrent navigation load. Reducing from 6 parallel jobs\n(3 browsers × 2 Node versions) to 3 jobs (3 browsers × 1 Node version)\nto prevent NS_ERROR_NET_EMPTY_RESPONSE errors from overwhelming the\nhttp-server instance.","tree":{"sha":"f5402091f8f0cebe1477ae7f5d09dad22648cc94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/trees/f5402091f8f0cebe1477ae7f5d09dad22648cc94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/commits/1df1ee8c59f7035ada11e81aeada1b13300fb78f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/1df1ee8c59f7035ada11e81aeada1b13300fb78f","node_id":"C_kwDOQTSjltoAKDFkZjFlZThjNTlmNzAzNWFkYTExZTgxYWVhZGExYjEzMzAwZmI3OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/larcjs/core/commit/550e615a25d9f2e187a66a88c37a658d5e57272d","sha":"550e615a25d9f2e187a66a88c37a658d5e57272d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/550e615a25d9f2e187a66a88c37a658d5e57272d"}],"sha":"1df1ee8c59f7035ada11e81aeada1b13300fb78f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/1df1ee8c59f7035ada11e81aeada1b13300fb78f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/commits/550e615a25d9f2e187a66a88c37a658d5e57272d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T13:37:12Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T13:37:12Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"Fix cross-browser test compatibility\n\nAll test files were hardcoding chromium.launch() which broke Firefox,\nWebKit, and mobile browser tests in CI. Updated all test files to use\nPlaywright''s browser-aware page and context fixtures instead.\n\nChanges:\n- pan-bus.test.mjs: Use { page } and { context } fixtures\n- pan-client.test.mjs: Use { page } and { context } fixtures\n- larc-integration.test.mjs: Use { page } and { context } fixtures\n- pan.test.mjs: Use { page } and { context } fixtures\n\nAll tests now work correctly across all Playwright projects (Chromium,\nFirefox, WebKit, Mobile Chrome, Mobile Safari).","tree":{"sha":"0e5f3aa56e952f26ec2b581e1b1b5caaadc2c735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/trees/0e5f3aa56e952f26ec2b581e1b1b5caaadc2c735"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/larcjs/core/git/commits/550e615a25d9f2e187a66a88c37a658d5e57272d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":87784