nski.us","name":"IVG-Design"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:25:14Z","email":"ilyav@gusinski.us","name":"IVG-Design"},"message":"chore(deps): bump @tauri-apps/api + cli to ^2.11 to unblock release CI\n\nTauri build fails when the Rust crate `tauri` and the npm `@tauri-apps/api`\npackage drift apart on minor. Cargo resolved tauri to 2.11.1 (npm was still\non 2.10.1), so v2.3.0 release builds aborted before tauri-action ran.\n\nBumps both `@tauri-apps/api` and `@tauri-apps/cli` to ^2.11.x. No code change\nrequired.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"797f4ccd4e071b624ec3ca49c46ecd276487f8a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ivg-design/rive-animation-viewer/git/trees/797f4ccd4e071b624ec3ca49c46ecd276487f8a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ivg-design/rive-animation-viewer/git/commits/a1d065ddfeb2604b7d3acbbb82c35531d8d17ca7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44062706?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ivg-design","id":44062706,"login":"ivg-design","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MDYyNzA2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivg-design","user_view_type":"public"},"html_ur