"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/5120f2cb2494aa4b4188d6eb3bf8838598d2c5f0","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKDUxMjBmMmNiMjQ5NGFhNGI0MTg4ZDZlYjNiZjg4Mzg1OThkMmM1ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/a3695136bfd043dda7d4180e8a1e337c06c0cc2b","sha":"a3695136bfd043dda7d4180e8a1e337c06c0cc2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/a3695136bfd043dda7d4180e8a1e337c06c0cc2b"}],"sha":"5120f2cb2494aa4b4188d6eb3bf8838598d2c5f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/5120f2cb2494aa4b4188d6eb3bf8838598d2c5f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/a3695136bfd043dda7d4180e8a1e337c06c0cc2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T20:18:59Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T20:18:59Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"fix(deps): close the extract-zip advisories with a puppeteer-browsers override\n\nGHSA-jmr9-qjv8-65gv and GHSA-7pqw-9j4j-h8q3 both reach this repo only through\n@size-limit/preset-app -> @size-limit/time -> estimo, which pins find-chrome-bin\nand puppeteer-core by exact version, and both of those pinned\n@puppeteer/browsers@2.10.10. No extract-zip release sits outside the advisory\nrange, so the dependency has to leave the tree rather than move inside it.\n\n@puppeteer/browsers drops extract-zip at 3.0.2; the 2.x line never does. One\nroot override, \">=3.0.2 <4\", resolves to 3.2.2 and removes extract-zip\nentirely: 7 high findings go to 0, with 2 moderate left (qs via\ntyped-rest-client via @stryker-mutator/core).\n\npuppeteer-core is deliberately NOT overridden. Forcing it past its own advisory\nrange was tried and broke the size gate: estimo deep-imports\npuppeteer-core/lib/cjs/puppeteer/revisions.js, and 25.0.2 moved that tree to\nlib/puppeteer/. Every version that drops extract-zip is 25.x, so all of them\nbreak estimo. It stays at 24.22.0 and leaves the audit anyway, because its only\nfinding was via @puppeteer/browsers.\n\nnpm''s suggested remediation, @size-limit/preset-app 11.0.0, is a semver-major\ndowngrade and stays rejected under the capped-floor doctrine.\n\nThe allowance for GHSA-jmr9-qjv8-65gv is removed in this commit: the override\nmakes it stale, and a stale allowance fails audit:gate by design.\n\nProof: npm run build, then npm run size:check launches headless Chrome through\nthe overridden chain and all five brotli budgets pass; audit:gate exits 0.","tree":{"sha":"2c0fb7ead8d594128524e84e5bb820efce1fea0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/2c0fb7ead8d594128524e84e5bb820efce1fea0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/a3695136bfd043dda7d4180e8a1e337c06c0cc2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/a3695136bfd043dda7d4180e8a1e337c06c0cc2b","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKGEzNjk1MTM2YmZkMDQzZGRhN2Q0MTgwZThhMWUzMzdjMDZjMGNjMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/de98ee603bee61eb34238dd515b0140ea5eacea2","sha":"de98ee603bee61eb34238dd515b0140ea5eacea2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/de98ee603bee61eb34238dd515b0140ea5eacea2"}],"sha":"a3695136bfd043dda7d4180e8a1e337c06c0cc2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/a3695136bfd043dda7d4180e8a1e337c06c0cc2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"logi