,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/bfc844effef35a409ba532e35c84f6c8ba59cd29","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKGJmYzg0NGVmZmVmMzVhNDA5YmE1MzJlMzVjODRmNmM4YmE1OWNkMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/8ec055aff52335977788ab2fd78795a1ea12921e","sha":"8ec055aff52335977788ab2fd78795a1ea12921e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/8ec055aff52335977788ab2fd78795a1ea12921e"}],"sha":"bfc844effef35a409ba532e35c84f6c8ba59cd29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/bfc844effef35a409ba532e35c84f6c8ba59cd29"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/8ec055aff52335977788ab2fd78795a1ea12921e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T16:46:38Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T16:46:38Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"feat(dx): cut the agent entry - a probe to look with, a situation index, one traced test path\n\nMeasured on a sibling project: an agent spends ~93% of its entry READING SOURCE and ~7% on the\ndocuments that load automatically, so the lever is pointing and looking, not shorter docs.\n\n`npm run probe -- <route> [widths]` renders the route, saves a PNG per width and prints the\nquantities the layout guards measure - one measurement instead of a round of reasoning about\npixels. It waits for the server explicitly, because `page.goto` does NOT retry a refused\nconnection (the first live run died exactly there, and the comment claiming otherwise was the\ndefect). It is an instrument, never a gate.\n\n`READING_INDEX.md` maps a SITUATION to the two or three files that answer it, and points rather\nthan restates so it cannot rot the way a summary does. Deliberately not `@`-imported: a pointer\nfile earns its tokens only when a task needs it.\n\n`test:one` gives the tracer the single-file path agents actually reach for, so the convenient\nroute stops going around the instrument. `/feat` gains a step 0: is this still needed (two of\nfive lanes there returned \"already done\" after ~430k tokens), and where does it live.\n\nAGENTS.md states which files each tool loads, because Cursor and Claude Code read different sets\nand AGENTS.md is the only one both read - a rule moved out of it can vanish for one of them.","tree":{"sha":"24816d41bbb9e6529a457dc99f594727c00811eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/24816d41bbb9e6529a457dc99f594727c00811eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/8ec055aff52335977788ab2fd78795a1ea12921e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/8ec055aff52335977788ab2fd78795a1ea12921e","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKDhlYzA1NWFmZjUyMzM1OTc3Nzg4YWIyZmQ3ODc5NWExZWExMjkyMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/df6feff5d32f2882fc0a205635c83785da03bc19","sha":"df6feff5d32f2882fc0a205635c83785da03bc19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/df6feff5d32f2882fc0a205635c83785da03bc19"}],"sha":"8ec055aff52335977788ab2fd78795a1ea12921e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/8ec055aff52335977788ab2fd78795a1ea12921e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/df6feff5d32f2882fc0a205635c83785da03bc19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:54:27Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:54:27Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"docs(gate): the law once, the mechanics once - my own restatements collapse\n\nAuditing a sibling repo for duplicated docs turned up three of the same class in\nwhat I shipped here today. The silence-is-a-failure rule and the port rule were\nstated in AGENTS and again in VERIFICATION; the rn gate measurement lived in\nthree files at once. Each now has one home - AGENTS carries the law, VERIFICATION\nthe mechanics, gate-tiers.json the numbers - and the others point. Also repaired\ntwo pre-push descriptions that still named verify:ci after the hook became\nphase-aware, which is the same drift caught one day later.","tree":{"sha":"91cf4ce98d9ecc1cd44208bd1af18b07aa8f07bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/91cf4ce98d9ecc1cd44208bd1af18b07aa8f07bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/df6feff5d32f2882fc0a205635c83785da03bc19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.