rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/e03e01653f9b5072c517030cabec813e4bf68a5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:23:47Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:23:47Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"feat(gate): phase-aware push, a measure moment, and lanes that move off a busy port\n\nPhase 0 (scaffold): audit + hooks + oxlint + format + tsc + lint + coverage -\nbuild, the web-vitals chunk check, size-limit and the prod e2e are skipped\nLOUDLY on every push, because before the first deploy there is no prod boundary\nfor them to guard. Phase 1 runs the full verify:ci. The phase lives in\ngate-tiers.json and flips in its own commit at the first deploy; GATE_PHASE=full\nforces the full chain; a missing or unknown phase resolves to FULL, so the\ndispatcher fails heavy and never silent.\n\nverify:measure names the moment the tiers lacked - build and look, legal at any\ntime - and e2e:one runs one named spec through the tracer instead of around it.\nBoth ride run-on-free-port: a busy base port moves the lane up (proven live:\n3000 held, ran on 3001) and no lane kills a server it did not start. The\nplaywright config now reads PORT and passes it to the webServer command, since\nVite reads neither PORT nor PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL. The push gate alone clears its\nown port: check-gate-env --kill-port, proven in both directions.","tree":{"sha":"88e48ca8e8612ab8ce293b6679216f251160e8dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/88e48ca8e8612ab8ce293b6679216f251160e8dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/e03e01653f9b5072c517030cabec813e4bf68a5f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/e03e01653f9b5072c517030cabec813e4bf68a5f","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKGUwM2UwMTY1M2Y5YjUwNzJjNTE3MDMwY2FiZWM4MTNlNGJmNjhhNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/fd31c05cfa26d373d8ce53a30f5cb49c4e0674fd","sha":"fd31c05cfa26d373d8ce53a30f5cb49c4e0674fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/fd31c05cfa26d373d8ce53a30f5cb49c4e0674fd"}],"sha":"e03e01653f9b5072c517030cabec813e4bf68a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/e03e01653f9b5072c517030cabec813e4bf68a5f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/fd31c05cfa26d373d8ce53a30f5cb49c4e0674fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:23:41Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T15:23:41Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"feat(gate): trace every gate run, and make check-hooks answer for its own repo\n\nPorted from the sibling templates: gate-trace.mjs wraps the verify chain and\ntest:e2e (exit codes pass through untouched, logging best-effort, GIT_*\nstripped, macOS runs ride caffeinate so a sleeping machine stops reading as a\ncode failure); gate-tiers.json holds moments, budgets and classes as DATA;\ntrace-report.mjs turns rows into findings and names no stage itself.\ncheck-hooks strips GIT_* from its own git call - inherited from a hook it\nanswers for a different repo - and gains the six-case test it never had.\nbench-verify follows the tracer wrapper to the inner script.","tree":{"sha":"b8bbe4a280081285699b1bcf0840a6c3ec076c45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/b8bbe4a280081285699b1bcf0840a6c3ec076c45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/fd31c05cfa26d373d8ce53a30f5cb49c4e0674fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/fd31c05cfa26d373d8ce53a30f5cb49c4e0674fd","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKGZkMzFjMDVjZmEyNmQzNzNkOGNlNTNhMzBmNWNiNDljNGUwNjc0ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/63012aaccb5d73d72a1cf455d21bb6fc425aaf73","sha":"63012aaccb5d73d72a1cf455d21bb6fc425aaf73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/63012aaccb5d73d72a1cf455d21bb6fc425aaf73"}],"sha":"fd31c05cfa26d373d8ce53a30f5cb49c4e0674fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/