ps://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/20386d3bb36b1c0ab8f866efa117260ce175839c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T10:31:22Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T10:31:22Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"docs(gate): a copy-only change routes to the cheap tier, not the pipeline\n\nA one-word i18n value edit was either unrouted or (next-seo) routed by the word\n\"i18n\" into verify:full, the heaviest rung. The check tables now split copy from\ninfrastructure: value edits in the locale JSON run format:check only; key changes\nstay a code-class change; the i18n routing/locale-set surface keeps the full rung.\nWrapping for new copy lengths belongs to the content-variance tier by design.","tree":{"sha":"6e662aef4e209104cb68627b53ac9679f1a7165f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/6e662aef4e209104cb68627b53ac9679f1a7165f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/20386d3bb36b1c0ab8f866efa117260ce175839c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.