it/732b19d73930a7754f41656b161a8e74c69cf7d9","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKDczMmIxOWQ3MzkzMGE3NzU0ZjQxNjU2YjE2MWE4ZTc0YzY5Y2Y3ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/764c5683fea8264b1f8c04334b41b81847e9e657","sha":"764c5683fea8264b1f8c04334b41b81847e9e657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/764c5683fea8264b1f8c04334b41b81847e9e657"}],"sha":"732b19d73930a7754f41656b161a8e74c69cf7d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/732b19d73930a7754f41656b161a8e74c69cf7d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/764c5683fea8264b1f8c04334b41b81847e9e657/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:32:38Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:32:38Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"docs(ci): restore the two names a stripped heredoc dropped from c363b0a\n\nThat commit body reads \"the Playwright cache holds browser BINARIES, and  skips its\n install exactly when that cache hits\". Two names were eaten by an unquoted heredoc that\nran them as command substitution: the subject of the sentence is\nscripts/ensure-playwright.mjs, and the install it skips is the --with-deps one.\n\nEmpty on purpose: the fix itself is already in the tree and the full reasoning is in the\ncomment above the \"Install browser system dependencies\" step in .github/workflows/ci.yml.\nAmending c363b0a would need a force-push to master, which this repo forbids, so the\ncorrection is a new commit rather than a rewritten one.\n\nLesson: quote the heredoc delimiter. An unquoted heredoc expands backticks, so the result\nreads as if a word is missing instead of failing loudly.","tree":{"sha":"348c110d9b2ed70f453ca040b19b3b2291028e26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/348c110d9b2ed70f453ca040b19b3b2291028e26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/764c5683fea8264b1f8c04334b41b81847e9e657","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/764c5683fea8264b1f8c04334b41b81847e9e657","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKDc2NGM1NjgzZmVhODI2NGIxZjhjMDQzMzRiNDFiODE4NDdlOWU2NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/dec45ac58fb544cc36b05d4a80b5026c9fc20856","sha":"dec45ac58fb544cc36b05d4a80b5026c9fc20856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/dec45ac58fb544cc36b05d4a80b5026c9fc20856"}],"sha":"764c5683fea8264b1f8c04334b41b81847e9e657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/764c5683fea8264b1f8c04334b41b81847e9e657"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/dec45ac58fb544cc36b05d4a80b5026c9fc20856/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:24:35Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T15:24:35Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"refactor(e2e): extract the in-page measurement into one shared module\n\nThe predicates were already shared; the ~120-line page.evaluate block was not, and the\ncopies drifted the way copies do. The form-field handling landed in one of them, so an\ninput read as an unlabelled icon-only control in the route spec and correctly in the\nfixture spec. Both were aligned by hand at the time; this removes the second copy.\n\nThe constraint that shapes the file: Playwright serialises the function source and\nevaluates it in the page, so it can reference nothing from module scope. Every helper is\nnested inside and the selectors arrive as the argument - an import would be undefined by\nthe time it runs in the browser. Both specs call it through a locator, which gives the\nidentical (element, arg) signature.\n\nHow tested: smoke:dev and test:e2e:prod green; re-proven by mutation - removing the wrap\nguard makes the harness report 30 overflow violations, reverting restores green.","tree":{"sha":"348c110d9b2ed70f453ca040b19b3b2291028e26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/348c110d9b2ed70f453ca040b19b3b2291028e26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/dec45ac58fb544cc36b05d4a80b5026c9fc20856","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/dec45ac58fb544cc36b05d4a80b5026c9fc20856","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKGRlYzQ1YWM1OGZiNTQ0Y2MzNmIwNWQ0YTgwYjUwMjZjOWZjMjA4NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/ddf7e83e343df69668869c6c8190479c61f14141","sha":"ddf7e83e343df69668869c6c8190479c61f14141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/ddf7e83e343df69668869c6c8190479c61f14141"}],"sha":"dec45ac58fb544cc36b05d4a80b5026c9fc20856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/dec45ac58fb544cc36b05d4a80b5026c9fc20856"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/ddf7e83e343df69668869c6c8190479c61f14141/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:45:12Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:45:12Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"fix(e2e): wait for load before measuring layout, not domcontentloaded\n\nFound by running Firefox on the sibling template: at `domcontentloaded` the stylesheet\nis not necessarily applied yet, so the page measures with UA defaults — a submit button\n18px tall and an input 19px, which look like catastrophic layout defects and are simply\nan unstyled snapshot. Chromium happened to apply the CSS before that event, so a\nsingle-engine run could not see it.\n\nA geometry measurement needs the render-blocking resources in, which is what `load`\nwaits for.","tree":{"sha":"26098ee65df00813328f493cd8717a78b3c97dbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/26098ee65df00813328f493cd8717a78b3c97dbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/ddf7e83e343df69668869c6c8190479c61f14141","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/ddf7e83e343df69668869c6c8190479c61f14141","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKGRkZjdlODNlMzQzZGY2OTY2ODg2OWM2YzgxOTA0NzljNjFmMTQxNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/c363b0a814360c6af0bcb594f729cafc2e3e8d90","sha":"c363b0a814360c6af0bcb594f729cafc2e3e8d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/c363b0a814360c6af0bcb594f729cafc2e3e8d90"}],"sha":"ddf7e83e343df69668869c6c8190479c61f14141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/ddf7e83e343df69668869c6c8190479c61f14141"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/c363b0a814360c6af0bcb594f729cafc2e3e8d90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:43:00Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:43:00Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"chore(ci): install browser system deps so a warm cache cannot break webkit\n\nThe Playwright cache holds browser BINARIES, and  skips its\n install exactly when that cache hits — so on the second run WebKit was\npresent and could not launch: libevent-2.1.so.7 missing. Chromium deps ship with the\nrunner image, WebKit deps do not.\n\nFound by watching the first run of a CI-only job rather than assuming it. The step is\nidempotent, so it costs nothing on a warm image.","tree":{"sha":"2703013cef671d036458e32e3323eb1c7809ad8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/2703013cef671d036458e32e3323eb1c7809ad8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/c363b0a814360c6af0bcb594f729cafc2e3e8d90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/c363b0a814360c6af0bcb594f729cafc2e3e8d90","node_id":"C_kwDOQT0KedoAKGMzNjNiMGE4MTQzNjBjNmFmMGJjYjU5NGY3MjljYWZjMmUzZThkOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-1/commit/2c204c27dc6364b3eeb827719b6d37f51bf2dda5","sha":"2c204c27dc6364b3eeb827719b6d37f51bf2dda5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/2c204c27dc6364b3eeb827719b6d37f51bf2dda5"}],"sha":"c363b0a814360c6af0bcb594f729cafc2e3e8d90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/c363b0a814360c6af0bcb594f729cafc2e3e8d90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/commits/2c204c27dc6364b3eeb827719b6d37f51bf2dda5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:17:27Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:20:31Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"fix(e2e): give the fixture a chrome-label source and align both measurements\n\nTwo defects in the harness itself, both found by porting it to a sibling whose\ntypical string is a sentence rather than a phrase.\n\nThe fixture fed one source string to every case, so the base Button - which keeps\nwhitespace-nowrap by contract - was measured against prose. On the sibling that put\n568px of content in a 292px column and read as a broken primitive rather than as a\nfixture using the wrong content kind. Labels and prose are now separate sources: a\nchrome label is short by contract, and sentence-length content in a button is the\nButtonRow case that renders the documented override.\n\nThe in-page measurement is duplicated between the two geometry specs, and the\nform-field handling had landed in only one of them - so a field read as an\nunlabelled icon-only control in the route spec and correctly in the fixture spec.\nBoth copies now agree: a field''s placeholder or value IS its visible text, and a\nfield scrolls its own value rather than overflowing. The duplication itself remains\nand is the follow-up: the predicates are shared, the measurement is not.\n\nHow tested: smoke:dev and test:e2e:prod green; the fixture unit suite still pins that\nevery state changes what is rendered.","tree":{"sha":"5b6fca88bf41faa4c0a269d62a3c31be0f0b8170","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/trees/5b6fca88bf41faa4c0a269d62a3c31be0f0b8170"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-1/git/commits/2c204c27dc6364b3eeb827719b6d37f51bf2dda5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https: