"id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/70c0e3e48cdfbddf42fe5027c25c50d0a6c50375/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:19:23Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:19:23Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"docs(ios): record the layer 9 review in the redesign spec\n\n- §11 criterion 1 annotated as not reached in layer 9 (AppView and\n  currentView still drive the fallback screens; native navigation\n  migration deferred).\n- Layer 7: corrected the claim that the template checklist was kept at\n  launch (persistCreationContext only wrote the always-nil\n  potentialLocationName); removed the now-resolved open point.\n- Layer 9: removed resolved known issues (dead creation context, AI\n  factory unreachable); new \"Couche 9 - Revue\" section with the\n  restorations (discussion tile, template checklist store, AI\n  suggestions card with heuristic fallback, weather in hub and event\n  day, add to calendar from the hub menu, QA seed wait), the accepted\n  losses (Inbox group handoff and notification delete/multi-select,\n  photos tile only when finalized, library hosting/attending filters,\n  notification chat report/block), simulator checks and open points.\n- AGENTS.md (Calendar agent): iOS has no CalendarIntegrationCard.swift;\n  the real path is AuthenticatedView.addInformationEventToCalendar ->\n  CalendarService.addToNativeCalendar from EventInformationView (only\n  with the invitation rollout) and from the hub menu; Compose card path\n  corrected to androidMain.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).","tree":{"sha":"2fe19bffaef9a028200ed423d62fae2b61619129","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/2fe19bffaef9a028200ed423d62fae2b61619129"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/70c0e3e48cdfbddf42fe5027c25c50d0a6c50375","verification":{"payload":"tree 2fe19bffaef9a028200ed423d62fae2b61619129\nparent a8718f216a577b7656ee3023afeaf44906e411a4\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790957963 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790957963 +0200\n\ndocs(ios): record the layer 9 review in the redesign spec\n\n- §11 criterion 1 annotated as not reached in layer 9 (AppView and\n  currentView still drive the fallback screens; native navigation\n  migration deferred).\n- Layer 7: corrected the claim that the template checklist was kept at\n  launch (persistCreationContext only wrote the always-nil\n  potentialLocationName); removed the now-resolved open point.\n- Layer 9: removed resolved known issues (dead creation context, AI\n  factory unreachable); new \"Couche 9 - Revue\" section with the\n  restorations (discussion tile, template checklist store, AI\n  suggestions card with heuristic fallback, weather in hub and event\n  day, add to calendar from the hub menu, QA seed wait), the accepted\n  losses (Inbox group handoff and notification delete/multi-select,\n  photos tile only when finalized, library hosting/attending filters,\n  notification chat report/block), simulator checks and open points.\n- AGENTS.md (Calendar agent): iOS has no CalendarIntegrationCard.swift;\n  the real path is AuthenticatedView.addInformationEventToCalendar ->\n  CalendarService.addToNativeCalendar from EventInformationView (only\n  with the invitation rollout) and from the hub menu; Compose card path\n  corrected to androidMain.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/2YsbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0NfcP/21S3cXQibQugjDkRC9W\nX8An/wUMPQoaR2AJKmQ65ICWjssseUVg+kxVt7KnK/MHg+MJKjHJc8GloZbvQQug\nYVxkAC4YNg6MBDoNKd/Ro0g85g+TTPvKV+evX+dCPP2ioZ7+K08KowSZkulareB8\nlAOGLCroMBMxrRKrHWDqcJjAVUS7biRebBGo4LOhQz38R88TbYoOllXWnBJN2ZFL\n8AhQ+p07U70NP+Ti3JUXfVwtjr3mtoPTtwe9y9X6XOmARVYdM7rVBfl0GEAnqs8u\nhMBq5iNkthdR9tXoILiFbre9GiKWHrZZq2aUC4u6n179VAf8mmVUqb838EEnb1WD\nkpPxEwGMeOL+p+4pX4b6VT18MWKCKST3hKuuJGSpZi8aPUlXBghFMFuQnoRnzv2G\nQF94SG7N0JJYNmQYsMteZKbUa+i1164g09fyS2gMuwjFFm5oIHZ6fA2TbZwm/0Iy\nTVB1fiPR3jMWQk012olLytTVEdmvpjZdOupi65AR1DaqDJxcFYx90EH3IPaLCD0R\n/n5vL2U5B8K3Xff+VCDo67igSjjUQvtERHYsUw8fCLBLShTyjzJpYBdcNoI5CQVP\nC6mX+9+Z19l+zx26JVjpEjFEeB3Nb8UXrvs27NankI8gB/LrmHMYUGMSb3KaEouS\nHlnP+t3WMM607kSY7qIrDUPP\n=QDIg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T16:30:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost/wakeve/commit/70c0e3e48cdfbddf42fe5027c25c50d0a6c50375","node_id":"C_kwDOQT3ZkNoAKDcwYzBlM2U0OGNkZmJkZGY0MmZlNTAyN2MyNWM1MGQwYTZjNTAzNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost/wakeve/commit/a8718f216a577b7656ee3023afeaf44906e411a4","sha":"a8718f216a577b7656ee3023afeaf44906e411a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/a8718f216a577b7656ee3023afeaf44906e411a4"}],"sha":"70c0e3e48cdfbddf42fe5027c25c50d0a6c50375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/70c0e3e48cdfbddf42fe5027c25c50d0a6c50375"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/a8718f216a577b7656ee3023afeaf44906e411a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:10:45Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:10:45Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"fix(ios): fall back to the heuristic client for failed AI suggestions\n\nOn the simulator, Foundation Models reports itself available but every\nhub generation failed or timed out, so the card only showed\n\"Les suggestions sont indisponibles\". Each part that the default client\n(WakeveAIClientFactory) fails to produce is now generated again with the\nlocal HeuristicWakeveAIClient (the client the legacy panel always used);\nsuccessful parts are kept. The fallback is injectable (nil in tests that\npin the failure state).\n\nTests: EventHubAITests.testFailingPartsFallBackToTheHeuristicClient.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).","tree":{"sha":"e7e6900dba0cb86d0a3ffb725b5efadae8f4e099","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/e7e6900dba0cb86d0a3ffb725b5efadae8f4e099"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/a8718f216a577b7656ee3023afeaf44906e411a4","verification":{"payload":"tree e7e6900dba0cb86d0a3ffb725b5efadae8f4e099\nparent c2925315248965b75cd8447df303b37adf2e59af\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790957445 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790957445 +0200\n\nfix(ios): fall back to the heuristic client for failed AI suggestions\n\nOn the simulator, Foundation Models reports itself available but every\nhub generation failed or timed out, so the card only showed\n\"Les suggestions sont indisponibles\". Each part that the default client\n(WakeveAIClientFactory) fails to produce is now generated again with the\nlocal HeuristicWakeveAIClient (the client the legacy panel always used);\nsuccessful parts are kept. The fallback is injectable (nil in tests that\npin the failure state).\n\nTests: EventHubAITests.testFailingPartsFallBackToTheHeuristicClient.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/14UbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0yYoP/RPVkn7NeOmw9RXLxnm2\nxIX9B5IbvlMpSiLTShcSGn1Razp9wuJ+W1o58U47gitWt5Y9NMfGqhljNkURs3a3\n07Je2s8Axyolnx+AS27bkjaWTX9U2Qpv+pChpbj14601N00EnOQ/axtsx+HTkZGs\nPMKUUNKm6SlbZZfpf3rGz6i4GlxPnaT4aVAohp7rNrsi2xZT4ROPfw48XukCxkCI