906e411a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/a8718f216a577b7656ee3023afeaf44906e411a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/c2925315248965b75cd8447df303b37adf2e59af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:07:26Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:07:26Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"fix(ios): add to calendar from the hub menu and end the QA seed wait\n\n- Hub menu: \"Ajouter au calendrier\" for confirmed, comparing,\n  organizing and finalized events when the viewer has detail access,\n  with or without the invitation rollout. It reuses\n  addInformationEventToCalendar (CalendarService.addToNativeCalendar via\n  PlatformCalendarServiceImpl), the action of the Information screen,\n  which only exists under the rollout: without it the action was\n  unreachable since layer 9.\n- QA (DEBUG): when InvitationExperienceQALaunchSupport.prepare returns\n  nil, invitationQALibraryIsSeedReady is now set to true, so the home no\n  longer waits indefinitely on the seed indicator.\n- Stale comments: ActivityView no longer refers to the removed InboxView;\n  EventDetailViewModel documents its only remaining use (event deletion\n  from Information) instead of a detail-screen usage example.\n\nTests: EventHubViewTests (menu rule with and without the rollout),\nLayer9ReviewFixTests (calendar wiring, QA nil path, localization).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).","tree":{"sha":"a809f66f85ccff6766f9c1838d160248dc843b69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/a809f66f85ccff6766f9c1838d160248dc843b69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/c2925315248965b75cd8447df303b37adf2e59af","verification":{"payload":"tree a809f66f85ccff6766f9c1838d160248dc843b69\nparent 7e67abe3ea5d8def8fe0471dc3248edf75dc3feb\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790957246 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790957246 +0200\n\nfix(ios): add to calendar from the hub menu and end the QA seed wait\n\n- Hub menu: \"Ajouter au calendrier\" for confirmed, comparing,\n  organizing and finalized events when the viewer has detail access,\n  with or without the invitation rollout. It reuses\n  addInformationEventToCalendar (CalendarService.addToNativeCalendar via\n  PlatformCalendarServiceImpl), the action of the Information screen,\n  which only exists under the rollout: without it the action was\n  unreachable since layer 9.\n- QA (DEBUG): when InvitationExperienceQALaunchSupport.prepare returns\n  nil, invitationQALibraryIsSeedReady is now set to true, so the home no\n  longer waits indefinitely on the seed indicator.\n- Stale comments: ActivityView no longer refers to the removed InboxView;\n  EventDetailViewModel documents its only remaining use (event deletion\n  from Information) instead of a detail-screen usage example.\n\nTests: EventHubViewTests (menu rule with and without the rollout),\nLayer9ReviewFixTests (calendar wiring, QA nil path, localization).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/1r4bFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0IHkP/3NAuGeql7D2sWSmplte\nYTYD5quZo5/uQ3DHo67MhUWcU6oW7L2S4dXvG29+CBtu1P+9l4iOzK74/9Mji6m0\n2IumXh9f3+Rkk9b/GcKQjvI1Rb2lklsDscseF6IAjiTdglcbo8FX6Xb+kqQxFuPl\nFzaaPaHwPz7dJQZZzaTrQXI26pAeWSetpXvlkVb1BjImotBiOEQKAmTJLdARlVYy\nFRDZbAINJaIZC3BlPXe7FHOVxwJ606G2Qp+Indx/PsxTCahKicw2VsejtTIeW81T\n4I4epYz8o8dmcZKuKuzkL0F6hAP5YQ7x1ekp8N6GWTWpYZM5k6LUo94i27H2h/r0\nbPYjR1bISspKDTtpUcXgv0eN8MkX+r75a0enrcyI8R9b8eE1Df9JsrBegg3qMhNS\nXVOD4b3wItIbqANgLV8xXlcozC+uwqQufTS4WxAXjFqZWxXeuuRE+KMyx8WmUg1M\nOU6e36b8TUJJAqhf6l+nVaO7PHRJ/SoTi9uKOxmNBYDoLxFxAw23qG3rrFbyPige\nwDUWi0zeKaGuxzDGnMiFne4Q88UEA4K6qxdBbz2boPVceIIilA0qQgWfBO+l6l4M\nO+t6jHtJ0YYEGPdCy7RF7y1vQg4VfdqO1ob1dVkXOaJefM7T3trm0W6ettoUjx/u\n6cJsXhFRWUGPUyMSLLMt3WwY\n=WTns\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T16:30:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost/wakeve/commit/c2925315248965b75cd8447df303b37adf2e59af","node_id":"C_kwDOQT3ZkNoAKGMyOTI1MzE1MjQ4OTY1Yjc1Y2Q4NDQ3ZGYzMDNiMzdhZGYyZTU5YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost/wakeve/commit/7e67abe3ea5d8def8fe0471dc3248edf75dc3feb","sha":"7e67abe3ea5d8def8fe0471dc3248edf75dc3feb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/7e67abe3ea5d8def8fe0471dc3248edf75dc3feb"}],"sha":"c2925315248965b75cd8447df303b37adf2e59af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/c2925315248965b75cd8447df303b37adf2e59af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/7e67abe3ea5d8def8fe0471dc3248edf75dc3feb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:05:26Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:05:26Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"feat(ios): show event weather in the hub and on the event day\n\nLayer 9 removed the legacy detail''s weather card (EventWeatherMapCard /\nEventWeatherViewModel); EventWeatherProvider was left reachable only from\nthe scenario comparison.\n\n- Pure rules (Models/EventWeatherDisplay.swift): EventWeatherRule (same\n  rule as the old card: retained date - confirmed, organizing, finalized -\n  and detail access; target = retained slot start, else final date;\n  shown only when the target day is within today..today+10, the\n  provider window), EventWeatherPlaceChoice (known coordinates from\n  EventDayPlaceResolver - selected scenario, else potential location -,\n  else the geocoded resolvedEventLocation row, else an MKLocalSearch by\n  \"name, address\", as the old view model did), EventWeatherState\n  (provider result -> available / hidden when out of window /\n  unavailable) and EventWeatherText (localized temperatures, rain chance,\n  title).\n- EventWeatherLoader reads the place off the main thread, searches MapKit\n  when needed and asks one shared CachedEventWeatherProvider(WeatherKit);\n  EventWeatherModel publishes the state.\n- Hub: EventHubWeatherCard above the checklist and AI cards (forecast, a\n  loading row, or a discreet \"unavailable\" line), loaded by the\n  container when the rule and window allow.\n- Event day: EventDayWeatherCard (immersive variant on mood.surface)\n  after the place card, only when a forecast is available.\n\nNew copy in 5 languages (fr: tutoiement).\nTests: EventWeatherDisplayTests (window, rule, target date, load target,\nplace choice order, provider mapping, formatting, localization, wiring).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).","tree":{"sha":"2c75735c27bd53ffa7d91f7da35b9418aa9bf5de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/2c75735c27bd53ffa7d91f7da35b9418aa9bf5de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/7e67abe3ea5d8def8fe0471dc3248edf75dc3feb","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c75735c27bd53ffa7d91f7da35b9418aa9bf5de\nparent cf7d7443859b522a495cf0b689318b137fd59627\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790957126 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790957126 +0200\n\nfeat(ios): show event weather in the hub and on the event day\n\nLayer 9 removed the legacy detail''s weather card (EventWeatherMapCard /\nEventWeatherViewModel); EventWeatherProvider was left reachable only from\nthe scenario comparison.\n\n- Pure rules (Models/EventWeatherDisplay.swift): EventWeatherRule (same\n  rule as the old card: retained date - confirmed, organizing, finalized -\n  and detail access; target = retained slot start, else final date;\n  shown only when the target day is within today..today+10, the\n  provider window), EventWeatherPlaceChoice (known coordinates from\n  EventDayPlaceResolver - selected scenario, else potential location -,\n  else the geocoded resolvedEventLocation row, else an MKLocalSearch by\n  \"name, address\", as the old view model did), EventWeatherState\n  (provider result -> available / hidden when out of window /\n  unavailable) and EventWeatherText (localized temperatures, rain chance,\n  title).\n- EventWeatherLoader reads the place off the main thread, searches MapKit\n  when needed and asks one shared CachedEventWeatherProvider(WeatherKit);\n  EventWeatherModel publishes the state.\n- Hub: EventHubWeatherCard above the checklist and AI cards (forecast, a\n  loading row, or a discreet \"unavailable\" line), loaded by the\n  container when the rule and window allow.\n- Event day: EventDayWeatherCard (immersive variant on mood.surface)\n  after the place card, only when a forecast is available.\n\nNew copy in 5 languages (fr: tutoiement).\nTests: EventWeatherDisplayTests (window, rule, target date, load target,\nplace choice order, provider mapping, formatting, localization, wiring).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/1kYbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0ztYP/3LJnrqAVxW3vZy/PJTE\n+Ui1FkONCNAm5UDGQf