43859b522a495cf0b689318b137fd59627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/cf7d7443859b522a495cf0b689318b137fd59627"}],"sha":"7e67abe3ea5d8def8fe0471dc3248edf75dc3feb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/7e67abe3ea5d8def8fe0471dc3248edf75dc3feb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/cf7d7443859b522a495cf0b689318b137fd59627/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:02:13Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:02:13Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"feat(ios): bring AI suggestions back to the event hub\n\nLayer 9 removed the legacy detail''s AI panel; the WakeveAI client,\nfactory and Foundation Models client were no longer reached by the UI.\n\nAdds a \"Suggestions\" card under the hub grid (EventHubAICard,\nEventHubAI rules, EventHubAIModel):\n- Gating as before: organizer or eligible participant (detail access),\n  never once finalized; poll ideas for the organizer only, in DRAFT or\n  POLLING.\n- Generated on demand (\"Générer\", then \"Générer à nouveau\"); nothing runs\n  when the hub opens. The client comes from WakeveAIClientFactory with\n  WakeveAIAvailabilityService (Foundation Models when available,\n  heuristic fallback) and runs in a detached task; each part (summary,\n  poll ideas, checklist, invitation messages) is independent, so one\n  failure keeps the others; all failing shows an error with a retry.\n- Context limited to what the hub already shows (title, retained date\n  or slot count, guest names).\n- Checklist ideas are added to the event checklist (merged with the\n  template checklist, de-duplicated; \"Dans la checklist\" once added).\n- Invitation message variants (simple, chaleureux, court) with copy and\n  share.\n- Poll ideas are free-text questions with no dates, and no API turns\n  them into time slots, so they are shown for review only; a DRAFT\n  organizer gets \"Ajouter des dates\" (the hub''s .addDates route, i.e.\n  the create-flow resume with the invitation rollout).\n\nNew copy in 5 languages (fr: tutoiement).\nTests: EventHubAITests (gating, add-dates shortcut, context, checklist\nde-duplication, variants, generation with a fake client incl. partial\nand total failure, heuristic client, localization, wiring).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).","tree":{"sha":"a4ec9caad3a9f6aecbf1b09d9d4c9d123ea49abc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/a4ec9caad3a9f6aecbf1b09d9d4c9d123ea49abc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/cf7d7443859b522a495cf0b689318b137fd59627","verification":{"payload":"tree a4ec9caad3a9f6aecbf1b09d9d4c9d123ea49abc\nparent 547c3bc3e4cde5942b8a84ac151d9856dd566098\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790956933 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790956933 +0200\n\nfeat(ios): bring AI suggestions back to the event hub\n\nLayer 9 removed the legacy detail''s AI panel; the WakeveAI client,\nfactory and Foundation Models client were no longer reached by the UI.\n\nAdds a \"Suggestions\" card under the hub grid (EventHubAICard,\nEventHubAI rules, EventHubAIModel):\n- Gating as before: organizer or eligible participant (detail access),\n  never once finalized; poll ideas for the organizer only, in DRAFT or\n  POLLING.\n- Generated on demand (\"Générer\", then \"Générer à nouveau\"); nothing runs\n  when the hub opens. The client comes from WakeveAIClientFactory with\n  WakeveAIAvailabilityService (Foundation Models when available,\n  heuristic fallback) and runs in a detached task; each part (summary,\n  poll ideas, checklist, invitation messages) is independent, so one\n  failure keeps the others; all failing shows an error with a retry.\n- Context limited to what the hub already shows (title, retained date\n  or slot count, guest names).\n- Checklist ideas are added to the event checklist (merged with the\n  template checklist, de-duplicated; \"Dans la checklist\" once added).\n- Invitation message variants (simple, chaleureux, court) with copy and\n  share.\n- Poll ideas are free-text questions with no dates, and no API turns\n  them into time slots, so they are shown for review only; a DRAFT\n  organizer gets \"Ajouter des dates\" (the hub''s .addDates route, i.e.\n  the create-flow resume with the invitation rollout).\n\nNew copy in 5 languages (fr: tutoiement).\nTests: EventHubAITests (gating, add-dates shortcut, context, checklist\nde-duplication, variants, generation with a fake client incl. partial\nand total failure, heuristic client, localization, wiring).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/1YUbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON08X0P/2UW+coOTXJ+x80MtKeh\n7tj/JQqc7PUdcLVKKr/UmTbCGmJbItobPPUvN55nOd/J55tfRrgVzyqmkQGiI5vP\n02OYazJ3lh4ZbfXvW7T/+Tr3ngE8wEV286FT/T1VJkbmTnX2Pfdhj8VMNVf6jjrj\nIL703M8yHYUNDX/FdAboEwI4L1VOGxfc22iRQiu