43859b522a495cf0b689318b137fd59627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/cf7d7443859b522a495cf0b689318b137fd59627"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/547c3bc3e4cde5942b8a84ac151d9856dd566098/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:48:03Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:48:03Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"feat(ios): keep the template checklist and show it in the hub\n\nThe legacy create sheet handed the chosen template''s checklist to the\nevent detail in memory (preparedCreationChecklists[event.id]) to seed\nits AI checklist; layer 9 removed both, so the 4-question flow''s\ntemplate checklist (form.checklist) was dropped at launch.\n\nThe shared schema has no checklist table (EquipmentItem is the gear\nlist), so the checklist is kept per event on this device:\nUserDefaultsEventChecklistStore (JSON keyed\n`wakeve.eventChecklist.<eventId>`, injectable via EventChecklistStoring),\nwith pure rules in EventChecklist (template seeding that keeps checked\nitems, de-duplicated suggestion additions, toggling, progress).\n- CreateEventFlow seeds the store after every saved step once a draft\n  exists (a draft closed and resumed keeps its checklist: it is read back\n  into form.checklist on hydrate) and launches with\n  EventCreationContext(form:).\n- EventCreationContext now carries only templateChecklist; the dead\n  potentialLocationName/sourceScenario are removed and\n  persistCreationContext (formerly a no-op) seeds the store at launch.\n- The hub shows an EventHubChecklistCard under the grid (items with\n  check toggles saved locally, \"1/3 faits\", \"saved on this device only\"\n  note) when there are items and the viewer has detail access.\n- Deleting the event from Information clears its local checklist.\n\nNew copy in 5 languages (fr: tutoiement).\nTests: EventChecklistTests (rules, store round trip, unreadable data,\ncreation context, hub visibility, flow/ContentView/hub wiring).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).","tree":{"sha":"dabc77af43c0fffb96eee83fe97e06149d30dc5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/dabc77af43c0fffb96eee83fe97e06149d30dc5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/547c3bc3e4cde5942b8a84ac151d9856dd566098","verification":{"payload":"tree dabc77af43c0fffb96eee83fe97e06149d30dc5d\nparent 2bb1fbf1564a51a3b1a32822277023e4783e5fd3\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790956083 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790956083 +0200\n\nfeat(ios): keep the template checklist and show it in the hub\n\nThe legacy create sheet handed the chosen template''s checklist to the\nevent detail in memory (preparedCreationChecklists[event.id]) to seed\nits AI checklist; layer 9 removed both, so the 4-question flow''s\ntemplate checklist (form.checklist) was dropped at launch.\n\nThe shared schema has no checklist table (EquipmentItem is the gear\nlist), so the checklist is kept per event on this device:\nUserDefaultsEventChecklistStore (JSON keyed\n`wakeve.eventChecklist.<eventId>`, injectable via EventChecklistStoring),\nwith pure rules in EventChecklist (template seeding that keeps checked\nitems, de-duplicated suggestion additions, toggling, progress).\n- CreateEventFlow seeds the store after every saved step once a draft\n  exists (a draft closed and resumed keeps its checklist: it is read back\n  into form.checklist on hydrate) and launches with\n  EventCreationContext(form:).\n- EventCreationContext now carries only templateChecklist; the dead\n  potentialLocationName/sourceScenario are removed and\n  persistCreationContext (formerly a no-op) seeds the store at launch.\n- The hub shows an EventHubChecklistCard under the grid (items with\n  check toggles saved locally, \"1/3 faits\", \"saved on this device only\"\n  note) when there are items and the viewer has detail access.\n- Deleting the event from Information clears its local checklist.\n\nNew copy in 5 languages (fr: tutoiement).\nTests: EventChecklistTests (rules, store round trip, unreadable data,\ncreation context, hub visibility, flow/ContentView/hub wiring).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/0jMbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0ezQP/All7wKb6lfPE4YG2vqi\nbDOPoLK031MCHWMOyLN5i67r6D4BAUNF9mh2R82Ny0kCxZoRzL6Uf29Pcx4UQKyx\n+m1L8VydWomePQ1qD//TQjdmCpQRm5jOn94KxxPJKwhTxedO88z8oIN/iiJUPInv\nPaF1Wqw4tsmjWqJalIIqxVzUSqqLXh8EqtdJ2BRkPkKFzmOE8Ih2L+BZGZiKVL+u\noDkkjGgyWsIZkYaEeRGWaonhjsePnu5IOjqKHoIuEaed8vaBz5qcv4JZ+GlJdckv\nowN3y4uKJW4JAaCUichsNyV+6emOef5wTjbNcwz+Xol5BX3dVp6Cjh94KdfE9AG3\nnSujryInrTuZqzzmqgo+VrYmezr2RHGCla7e6RFGonJZLW/SvwnRoVoHdpQ8yski\n3s8ulGSYhDWr+X78QgWVi1KVBG2o4aQJ4BNN3OFmebz22CgBl+9G3JCHujNpPuib\nEEwRz0WgQfxFATbFEjq+N/kjvhVkDc1BbC1Ka+f1v8uOXUEzIffO3paARABvGQWN\n2rLCMAj6mkErxUQ7MJarksIEImU2PVPdAbef7r24n7EA