ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/2bb1fbf1564a51a3b1a32822277023e4783e5fd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:43:38Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:43:38Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"fix(ios): give the event hub an entry to the general discussion\n\nLayer 9 removed the legacy detail and with it the messages preview, the\nonly in-app entry to an event''s general comment thread (only the\nActivity \"messages\" row and the `.comments` deep link remained).\n\nAdds a Discussion tile (HubModule.discussion) from CONFIRMED onward\n(confirmed, comparing, organizing, finalized). It routes like the\nActivity messages row: selectedCommentSection = .general then\nnavigateInvitationDeepLink(destination: .comments), same guards. The\ntile follows the comments screen guard (canAccessDetailedPlanning):\nlocked without detail access. It is not shown in DRAFT/POLLING because\nthe comments screen refuses access before the date is retained, so a\ntile there would be locked for everyone.\n\nTests: EventHubDiscussionTests (phases, lock rule, routing with and\nwithout the invitation rollout, hint, ContentView wiring); phase module\nlists updated in EventHubModelTests/EventHubViewTests.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).","tree":{"sha":"4537f9a3ebe19067168aa256697ca267c5f2eeb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/4537f9a3ebe19067168aa256697ca267c5f2eeb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/2bb1fbf1564a51a3b1a32822277023e4783e5fd3","verification":{"payload":"tree 4537f9a3ebe19067168aa256697ca267c5f2eeb7\nparent 2e02fcef823c7c5e3f39c7fc2c3729f504866b37\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790955818 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790955818 +0200\n\nfix(ios): give the event hub an entry to the general discussion\n\nLayer 9 removed the legacy detail and with it the messages preview, the\nonly in-app entry to an event''s general comment thread (only the\nActivity \"messages\" row and the `.comments` deep link remained).\n\nAdds a Discussion tile (HubModule.discussion) from CONFIRMED onward\n(confirmed, comparing, organizing, finalized). It routes like the\nActivity messages row: selectedCommentSection = .general then\nnavigateInvitationDeepLink(destination: .comments), same guards. The\ntile follows the comments screen guard (canAccessDetailedPlanning):\nlocked without detail access. It is not shown in DRAFT/POLLING because\nthe comments screen refuses access before the date is retained, so a\ntile there would be locked for everyone.\n\nTests: EventHubDiscussionTests (phases, lock rule, routing with and\nwithout the invitation rollout, hint, ContentView wiring); phase module\nlists updated in EventHubModelTests/EventHubViewTests.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9 review).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/0SobFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0jMAP/3sCUlqrDsCK74TVuCvt\nznLi/RIA/xekWhDVojBCYESwZFYdBO5zGfedMTqVkOAbLfdu5vDZg4i1TkXmRPZx\n4umtMn+bldLwN2epUa1Ysas350jrF567WzHC9KEUmyXtOY+Llttv2ZstZbhuxSUU\nGPS6uNlPVUOY7oeDg/as+VJ0H/S0wXVJOClZ1VVA8zGYwY3n1j8dfRjlNZq