 they stay non-zero, leaderboard\n  back route, wakeve://settings semantics, simulator verification, test\n  results and known remaining issues; the orphan-keys open point is closed.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).","tree":{"sha":"3e3f032fc6cf6a3f13dd4ac1386abfa141c69849","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/3e3f032fc6cf6a3f13dd4ac1386abfa141c69849"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/2e02fcef823c7c5e3f39c7fc2c3729f504866b37","verification":{"payload":"tree 3e3f032fc6cf6a3f13dd4ac1386abfa141c69849\nparent f58055cd01cdb8df1f74d916286102f1c81c91a1\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790954483 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790954483 +0200\n\ndocs(ios): record layer 9 switch in redesign spec\n\n- §9: layer 9 row (flag removed, legacy screens/components/keys removed,\n  non-zero guard baselines) and guard paragraph; intro no longer claims\n  a single redesign2026 flag replacing iosInvitationExperienceV1.\n- §11: acceptance criteria 4 and 5 marked not reached at layer 9.\n- §13: rollback is a revert of the layer-9 PR; no kill switch is kept.\n- §15 \"Couche 9\": switch, what was removed (approx. line counts), BREAKING\n  losses (scenario-matrix creation outside the studio, AI smart draft at\n  creation), measured baselines and why they stay non-zero, leaderboard\n  back route, wakeve://settings semantics, simulator verification, test\n  results and known remaining issues; the orphan-keys open point is closed.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/y/MbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0bl8QAKpSwBRbdkUfq5E+Ul8b\ncLmUZ3Y8O1QZBZQ8FJl9/RDlEiwyD1Vi52n+3NhjRPJWcYzOOeM7yWuDcLysDuX/\nbbUUMHlCAUJs2WhJSZPU8IlsDE63JJlbOxI7FrZdDOjztGi00EdKRwuVm/QolCe3\nrvXbByOt3cLo/BMdTUGUq+tDlJxnR35O5WHUKQvRnw1Vu8rIxBxfXhTssjJn6MTl\noJUsXdvv3uns4P1+84f7OeMS26U6tmiU0jUdNBiE50z197qbn+6YgBRuDAV1Il