host","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/e74764755ad7782e7549d5921d7b480129c3c502/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:06:26Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:06:26Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"chore(ios): remove unused localization keys\n\nRemoves 852 keys from each of the 5 Localizable.strings catalogs (en, fr,\nes, it, pt: 2305 -> 1453 keys each, same key set in every language);\nsection headers left empty are dropped. Localizable.stringsdict is\nunchanged (all 19 plural keys are used). plutil -lint passes on all 10\nfiles.\n\nMethod: a key is kept if it appears as a quoted literal in iosApp/src\n(Swift, plists, Siri strings), in shared/server Kotlin, or bare in\niosApp/src; every key matching a dynamically built prefix\n(\"prefix.\\(...)\": activity.entry., activity.group., budget.category.,\ncreate_flow.{location,slot}.{error,remove}., create_flow.question.,\ncreate_flow.subtitle., create_flow.template., create_flow.type.,\nevent.lifecycle.blocker., home.card., hub.module., hub.sheet., hub.tile.,\nwk.nav.) is kept conservatively. Keys referenced only by tests were\nremoved only when they pinned removed UI.\n\nRemoved per prefix (per language): event.* 201, events.* 93, inbox.* 93,\ncreate_event.* 84, gamification.* 54, notifications.* 39, home.* 34,\nexplore.* 34, accommodation.* 32, dashboard.* 31, equipment.* 23,\nmeetings.* 20, ai.* 19, common.* 12, status.* 9, weather.* 9,\ninvitation.* 9, profile.* 7, activity.* 6, event_info.* 5, other 38\n(tab.*, settings.*, filter.*, poll.*, the unprefixed language_* picker\nkeys, ...).\n\nTests adapted (keys that only pinned removed UI):\n- InvitationExperienceLocalizationRedTests: invitation.library.* and\n  invitation.action.view_archive (EventLibraryView removed).\n- ParityRouteInventoryContractTests.testRouteLocalizationKeysExistInSupportedLocales:\n  event.detail.organization.*_label (legacy EventDetailView rows removed).\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testVisibleFindingStringsAreLocalized:\n  inbox.filter.* (legacy Inbox removed) and profile.edit (no profile edit\n  control remains); .testUgcModerationReportBlockControlsAreReviewerVisible:\n  moderation.report_chat_context (InboxDetailView chat report removed).\n- PollConfirmationWorkflowContractTests.testSyncedStateHasVisibleVoiceOverCopyWithoutDeliveryClaims:\n  reads the synced VoiceOver copy from the key the view actually uses\n  (poll.results.confirmation.accessibility.synced) instead of the unused\n  duplicate poll.results.confirmation.synced.accessibility.synced.\nNo test deleted.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).","tree":{"sha":"6847f84209a73a73fd3d02d9befb68f6f51cd1a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/6847f84209a73a73fd3d02d9befb68f6f51cd1a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/e74764755ad7782e7549d5921d7b480129c3c502","verification":{"payload":"tree 6847f84209a73a73fd3d02d9befb68f6f51cd1a4\nparent 34cab7445685d6da6fc085455e2825b92da224c9\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790953586 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790953586 +0200\n\nchore(ios): remove unused localization keys\n\nRemoves 852 keys from each of the 5 Localizable.strings catalogs (en, fr,\nes, it, pt: 2305 -> 1453 keys each, same key set in every language);\nsection headers left empty are dropped. Localizable.stringsdict is\nunchanged (all 19 plural keys are used). plutil -lint passes on all 10\nfiles.\n\nMethod: a key is kept if it appears as a quoted literal in iosApp/src\n(Swift, plists, Siri strings), in shared/server Kotlin, or bare in\niosApp/src; every key matching a dynamically built prefix\n(\"prefix.\\(...)\": activity.entry., activity.group., budget.category.,\ncreate_flow.{location,slot}.{error,remove}., create_flow.question.,\ncreate_flow.subtitle., create_flow.template., create_flow.type.,\nevent.lifecycle.blocker., home.card., hub.module., hub.sheet., hub.tile.,\nwk.nav.) is kept conservatively. Keys referenced only by tests were\nremoved only when they pinned removed UI.\n\nRemoved per prefix (per language): event.* 201, events.* 93, inbox.* 93,\ncreate_event.* 84, gamification.* 54, notifications.* 39, home.* 34,\nexplore.* 34, accommodation.* 32, dashboard.* 31, equipment.* 23,\nmeetings.* 20, ai.* 19, common.* 12, status.* 9, weather.* 9,\ninvitation.* 9, profile.* 7, activity.* 6, event_info.* 5, other 38\n(tab.*, settings.*, filter.*, poll.*, the unprefixed language_* picker\nkeys, ...).\n\nTests adapted (keys that only pinned removed UI):\n- InvitationExperienceLocalizationRedTests: invitation.library.* and\n  invitation.action.view_archive (EventLibraryView removed).\n- ParityRouteInventoryContractTests.testRouteLocalizationKeysExistInSupportedLocales:\n  event.detail.organization.*_label (legacy EventDetailView rows removed).\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testVisibleFindingStringsAreLocalized:\n  inbox.filter.* (legacy Inbox removed) and profile.edit (no profile edit\n  control remains); .testUgcModerationReportBlockControlsAreReviewerVisible:\n  moderation.report_chat_context (InboxDetailView chat report removed).\n- PollConfirmationWorkflowContractTests.testSyncedStateHasVisibleVoiceOverCopyWithoutDeliveryClaims:\n  reads the synced VoiceOver copy from the key the view actually uses\n  (poll.results.confirmation.accessibility.synced) instead of the unused\n  duplicate poll.resul