s iosApp/src and the\ntest targets; nothing still used by reachable code is removed. The legacy\ndesign system used by the kept full-screen fallback screens stays.\n\nRemoved (unreferenced after the shell switch and legacy removals):\n- components: AIBadgeView + AISuggestionModels (AIBadge, AIMetadata,\n  recommendations), LiquidGlassTextField, AddToCalendarButton, GlassBadge,\n  EventListRow, ParticipantAvatarStack, BottomSheet, LoadingSkeleton,\n  WakeveEventPanel, WakeveSearchField, WakeveStackedAvatars,\n  WakeveSectionHeader, WakeveListRow, WakeveWidgetPreviewCard/Gallery,\n  SharedComponents'' InfoRow, StatusBadge, FilterChip, VoteChip,\n  SectionHeader, EmptyStateView, LoadingView, ActionRow, RatingDisplay,\n  ScaleButtonStyle (WakeveHaptics, PollVote and PriceDisplay kept),\n  PollVotingView''s VoteGuideRow and TimeSlotVoteCard;\n- theme: IconographyGuidelines, LiquidGlassAnimations.swift (every helper\n  unused), thin/ultra-thin/thick glass modifiers, the top-level\n  AdaptiveColors/Typography/Spacing/CornerRadius/Shadows structs,\n  Color.dynamic, cardStyle()/tabBarShadow(), unused Color.wakeve*/app*/iOS*\n  statics, unused WakeveColors members and gradient presets, unused\n  WakeveTheme members (Blur, skeleton fills, sheet/tab/quick motion,\n  tab-bar/bottom-sheet radii, birthday/outdoor/work gradients...),\n  TypographyTokens.bodyEmphasis;\n- view models/services: ProfileViewModel, ScenarioDetailViewModel,\n  LocalizationService;\n- AI smart draft path: EventDraftGenerator, EventDraftSection and\n  SmartEventDraftState (the client''s generateEventDraft, used by the\n  remaining AI boundary, is kept);\n- write-only EventCreationContext.preparedChecklist (and the form''s\n  preparedChecklist), the never-opened showNotificationPreferencesSheet\n  sheet in AuthenticatedView, the trivial normalAppRoot indirection in\n  iOSApp.\n\nDeleted tests (they only pinned removed code):\n- PremiumDesignSystemContractTests.testAddToCalendarButtonUsesLocalizedVisibleCopy\n  - AddToCalendarButton removed;\n  .testParticipantAvatarStackUsesSingularAccessibilityLabel\n  - ParticipantAvatarStack removed;\n  .testSharedAnimationsHonorReduceMotion - the animated shared components\n  (chips, ScaleButtonStyle) are removed;\n  .testLiquidGlassAnimationEntryPointsAndBadgeHonorReduceMotion\n  - LiquidGlassAnimations removed;\n  .testLiquidGlassTextFieldUsesSemanticErrorsAndAccessibleIconButtons\n  - LiquidGlassTextField removed.\n- DesignTokensContractTests.testWarmIvoryDarkMatchesMidnight - unused\n  Color.wakeveWarmIvoryDark removed (dark background still pinned by\n  testSemanticAppBackgroundDarkUnchanged).\n- WakeveAIContractTests.testAIBadgeCopyUsesWakeveTone - AIBadgeView and\n  AISuggestionModels removed.\n- WakeveAIGeneratorTests.testEventDraftGeneratorStreamsExpectedSectionsFromFakeClient,\n  .testEventDraftGeneratorFallsBackWhenAvailabilityIsUnsupported,\n  .testEventDraftGeneratorReportsTimeout (+ its SlowWakeveAIClient helper)\n  - EventDraftGenerator removed.\n\nAdapted (behavior kept):\n- PremiumDesignSystemContractTests: component/token lists without the\n  removed ones; brand identity without IconographyGuidelines; branded\n  previews without the widget gallery; Reduce Motion contract kept on\n  onboarding (testOnboardingContinuousMotionHonorsReduceMotion);\n  typography contract re-anchored on WakeveTheme.Typography; semantic\n  accent contract on LocationSelectionSheet only\n  (testLegacySheetsUseSemanticAccentColors); slices re-anchored.\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testProfilePrioritizesOrganizerTrustOverGamification:\n  ProfileViewModel assertions dropped (file removed).\n- CreateEventFlowWiringTests.testFlowCoverIsInstalledOnTheShellRoot (was\n  testFlowCoverIsAddedAfterTheNotificationPreferencesSheet).\n- CreateEventFlowModelTests.testScenarioPrefillsWhatAndChecklist: no\n  preparedChecklist assertion.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).","tree":{"sha":"1fa78bf86ea7a82a1547ca72c1bd72b47cace990","url":"https://api.github.com/r