anticAccentColors); slices re-anchored.\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testProfilePrioritizesOrganizerTrustOverGamification:\n  ProfileViewModel assertions dropped (file removed).\n- CreateEventFlowWiringTests.testFlowCoverIsInstalledOnTheShellRoot (was\n  testFlowCoverIsAddedAfterTheNotificationPreferencesSheet).\n- CreateEventFlowModelTests.testScenarioPrefillsWhatAndChecklist: no\n  preparedChecklist assertion.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/xrwbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0R60P/i201irHrKumSs4AqtgS\nmpuGRiUqJTdkSkydr6gzZjGs4fOft2wdjegz5Pwbnk1GpygTFg3uFe7N+emCTwfy\nN7E3NmQ+S/HbS1IyLMnvw0Z6MyCJrGnyvd+tZ2wNa7jlFE7mOiLZfTjFB38duC3T\n9lTI1wb/FqvYgkFRAZvMnjpVC+50AWeqcAdsD4YDWzJvzNumRaQnxsJF/QJEP8tR\nUPByWT2zNfF3DUMRw3inLfXNlUTYWgYqLO2VnX5gui7h9+/3xp7J9eEi7xxqy7Kk\n3CSNcBjQGO6hcBhMYNxQoufIfv8ueo/sTg1BPhwetfu7N2ARkcaOdg4+TRrVcQ0+\nL8+miGCDp4vmAANwhL8XdT7gnB5anfg4fnGotHYa5W4kvVkNgJo1Ijy+nX6iADxF\ns43qRBL7+xwzbRFduKLud+BW0DmncAOFj/xjBmar8LLQr05UitwlZFDdUj+oz5dl\nNi4Qh4aamtph55wuAbQJIYnlBc4Tv6SiJnEFbQAmIh9kvgi2EFa5KfmoXp+FnDkt\nOAE+1ebzW47I3Xz6Q7CyoPjwwIvRIBZhtB9+JaYL7++oR1dvBFZD4tDmr9qa3OUb\nP67JVSlISWtYIzGNYdkb7dYRgK+kDMk5fQ8wDEp/sSHI7V/gNYkWpr3pn7EXL4Hy\nUkhM9gA4NPH5CDh7dTObQr2c\n=9plu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T16:30:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost/wakeve/commit/34cab7445685d6da6fc085455e2825b92da224c9","node_id":"C_kwDOQT3ZkNoAKDM0Y2FiNzQ0NTY4NWQ2ZGE2ZmMwODU0NTVlMjgyNWI5MmRhMjI0Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost/wakeve/commit/87cea96b9f1f93f175f5835cec1ae1bd85b50501","sha":"87cea96b9f1f93f175f5835cec1ae1bd85b50501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/87cea96b9f1f93f175f5835cec1ae1bd85b50501"}],"sha":"34cab7445685d6da6fc085455e2825b92da224c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/34cab7445685d6da6fc085455e2825b92da224c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/87cea96b9f1f93f175f5835cec1ae1bd85b50501/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:39:41Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:39:41Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"refactor(ios)!: remove the legacy create sheet\n\nCreation now goes only through the redesign entry points (＋, empty\nhome, `wakeve://event/create`): the 4-question flow, or the studio\nunder the invitation rollout. Removes:\n- CreateEventSheet.swift (wizard, preview, slot/date pickers, type\n  picker) and its fullScreenCover, showEventCreationSheet and the\n  always-nil eventCreationScenario state in AuthenticatedView;\n- the CreateEventViewModel view model and its AI smart-draft part;\n- EventInfoSheet and BackgroundPickerSheet (sheet-only).\nEventCreationContext moves to Models/Create/EventCreationContext.swift;\nEventTimeSlotInput, EventSlotInputBuilder and EventTimeSlotFactory move\nto Models/Create/EventSlotInput.swift (used by the create flow and the\ndraft-dates controller). The studio fallback without the invitation\nrollout (invitationExperienceLegacyCreationFallback, still reachable if\nthe rollout turns off on `.eventCreation`) becomes\ncreationFallbackWithoutStudio and opens the 4-question flow instead of\nthe removed sheet.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: legacy create sheet removed (scenario-matrix creation outside the studio and the AI smart draft at creation are no longer available).\n\nDeleted tests (they only pinned removed code):\n- PremiumCreateEventContractTests (10 tests, whole file):\n  testCreateEventUsesLightweightFiveStepFlow,\n  testCreateEventUsesPremiumControlsAndBottomAction,\n  testCreateEventPreservesCreationViewModelAndDateSlotContract,\n  testCreateEventDateStepSupportsMultipleSlots,\n  testCreateEventFinalStepOpensPreviewBeforeCreation,\n  testCreateEventRequiresOnlyTitleForSimpleEventsWithDescriptionFallback,\n  testCreateEventCarriesTemplateAndPotentialLocationContext,\n  testCreateEventVisibleDateFormattingUsesUserLocale,\n  testInvitationPreviewRemainingOptionsCopyIsLocalized,\n  testPreviewConfirmationUsesTheSingleInFlightGateForLoadingAndDoubleTapProtection\n  - CreateEventSheet removed.\n- PremiumEventDetailContractTests.testEventInfoSheetUsesLocalizationKeys\n  (last test of the file) - EventInfoSheet removed.\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testCreateEventTurnsSelectedDateIntoProposedSlot,\n  .testCreateEventTurnsMultipleSelectedSlotsIntoProposedSlots,\n  .testCreateEventCompletionIsEmittedOnlyAfterTheStateMachinePersists,\n  .testRapidDoubleCreateIsGatedByOneInFlightOperation - CreateEventViewModel\n  removed; .testLegacyCreationWiringDoesNotSaveTwiceOrDismissBeforeOwnerCompletion,\n  .testInvitationPreviewReservesHeaderSpaceForTitle - CreateEventSheet removed.\n- QABlockersRegressionTests.testDraftWithoutDatesIsCreated,\n  .testRepeatedCreationFailureAlwaysSettles - CreateEventViewModel removed;\n  .testWizardKeepsDatesOptionalAndSurfacesCreationFailures - sheet removed.\n- WakeveAIContractTests.testCreateEventSmartDraftUsesViewModelAndExplicitActions,\n  .testCreateEventViewModelOwnsSmartDraftGeneration,\n  .testCreateEventViewModelAttachesSmartDraftMetadata,\n  .testCreateEventViewModelHandlesSmartDraftFallbackTimeoutCancellationAndStreaming,\n  .testCreateEventSheetKeepsSmartDraftApplyAndIgnoreExplicit,\n  .testCreateEventSmartDraftMaterializesDatesAndChecklistIntoWizardState,\n  .testCreateEventSmartDraftDateParsingUsesCurrentUserLocale\n  - smart draft at creation removed.\n\nRe-anchored (behavior kept):\n- AllDaySlotAndGuestFinalizeTests.testCreateFlowUsesTheSlotBuilderAndAnEveningDefaultStart\n  (was testWizardUsesTheSlotBuilderAndATappableAllDayToggle): slot\n  builder and evening default on the create flow; the pure\n  EventSlotInputBuilder tests are unchanged.\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testEventTypeDisplayUsesLocalizedHelper: on\n  CreateEventFlowSteps.\n- PremiumDesignSystemContractTests: touch targets, typography budgets,\n  semantic colors and Reduce Motion without the removed sheets\n  (testSharedAndCreateEventAnimationsHonorReduceMotion renamed\n  testSharedAnimationsHonorReduceMotion).\n- ParityRouteInventoryContractTests (creationFallbackWithoutStudio),\n  OrganizationPhase7ContractTests (scenario empty state without the sheet\n  completion), PremiumNavigationContractTests (sheet list).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).","tree":{"sha":"0471abc98ead39d3243cbe35f58db666dc97a29a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/0471abc98ead39d3243cbe35f58db666dc97a29a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/87cea96b9f1f93f175f5835cec1ae1bd85b50501","verification":{"payload":"tree 0471abc98ead39d3243cbe35f58db666dc97a29a\nparent 66a03f4ce7687c8e9dba8f9b5b67f9adc630ebe3\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790951981 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790951981 +0200\n\nrefactor(ios)!: remove the legacy create sheet\n\nCreation now goes only through the redesign entry points (＋, empty\nhome, `wakeve://event/create`): the 4-question flow, or the studio\nunder the invitation rollout. Removes:\n- CreateEventSheet.swift (wizard, preview, slot/date pickers, type\n  picker) and its fullScreenCover, showEventCreationSheet and the\n  always-nil eventCreationScenario state in AuthenticatedView;\n- the CreateEventViewModel view model and its AI smart-draft part;\n- EventInfoSheet and BackgroundPickerSheet (sheet-only).\nEventCreationContext moves to Models/Create/EventCreationContext.swift;\nEventTimeSlotInput, EventSlotInputBuilder and EventTimeSlotFactory move\nto Models/Create/EventSlotInput.swift (used by the create flow and the\ndraft-dates controller). The studio fallback without the invitation\nrollout (invitationExperienceLegacyCreationFallback, still reachable if\nthe rollout turns off on `.eventCreation`) becomes\ncreationFallbackWithoutStudio and opens the 4-question flow instead of\nthe removed sheet.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: legacy create sheet removed (scenario-matrix creation outside the studio and the AI smart draft at creation are no longer available).\n\nDeleted tests (they only pinned removed code):\n- PremiumCreateEventContractTests (10 tests, whole file):\n  testCreateEventUsesLightweightFiveStepFlow,\n  testCreateEventUsesPremiumControlsAndBottomAction,\n  testCreateEventPreservesCreationViewModelAndDateSlotContract,\n  testCreateEventDateStepSupportsMultipleSlots,\n  testCreateEventFinalStepOpensPreviewBeforeCreation,\n  testCreateEventRequiresOnlyTitleForSimpleEventsWithDescriptionFallback,\n  testCreateEventCarriesTemplateAndPotentialLocationContext,\n  testCreateEventVisibleDateFormattingUsesUserLocale,\n  testInvitationPreviewRemainingOptionsCopyIsLocalized,\n  testPreviewConfirmationUsesTheSingleInFlightGateForLoadingAndDoubleTapProtection\n  - CreateEventSheet removed.\n- PremiumEventDetailContractTests.testEventInfoSheetUsesLocalizationKeys\n  (last test of the file) - EventInfoSheet removed.\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testCreateEventTurnsSelectedDateIntoProposedSlot,\n  .testCreateEventTurnsMultipleSelectedSlotsIntoProposedSlots,\n  .testCreateEventCompletionIsEmittedOnlyAfterTheStateMachinePersists,\n  .testRapidDoubleCreateIsGatedByOneInFlightOperation - CreateEventViewModel\n  removed; .testLegacyCreationWiringDoesNotSaveTwiceOrDismissBeforeOwnerCompletion,\n  .testInvitationPreviewReservesHeaderSpaceForTitle - CreateEventSheet removed.\n- QABlockersRegressionTests.testDraftWithoutDatesIsCreated,\n  .testRepeatedCreationFailureAlwaysSettles - CreateEventViewModel removed;\n  .testWizardKeepsDatesOptionalAndSurfacesCreationFailures - sheet removed.\n- WakeveAIContractTests.testCreateEventSmartDraftUsesViewModelAndExplicitActions,\n  .testCreateEventViewModelOwnsSmartDraftGeneration,\n  .testCreateEventViewModelAttachesSmartDraftMetadata,\n  .testCreateEventViewModelHandlesSmartDraftFallbackTimeoutCancellationAndStreaming,\n  .testCreateEventSheetKeepsSmartDraftApplyAndIgnoreExplicit,\n  .testCreateEventSmartDraftMaterializesDatesAndChecklistIntoWizardState,\n  .testCreateEventSmartDraftDateParsingUsesCurrentUserLocale\n  - smart draft at creation removed.\n\nRe-anchored (behavior kept):\n- AllDaySlotAndGuestFinalizeTests.testCreateFlowUsesTheSlotBuilderAndAnEveningDefaultStart\n  (was testWizardUsesTheSlotBuilderAndATappableAllDayToggle): slot\n  builder and evening default on the create flow; the pure\n  EventSlotInputBuilder tests are unchanged.\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testEventTypeDisplayUsesLocalizedHelper: on\n  CreateEventFlowSteps.\n- PremiumDesignSystemContractTests: touch targets, typography budgets,\n  semantic colors and Reduce Motion without the removed sheets\n  (testSharedAndCreateEventAnimationsHonorReduceMotion renamed\n  testSharedAnimationsHonorReduceMotion).\n- ParityRouteInventoryContractTests (creationFallbackWithoutStudio),\n  OrganizationPhase7ContractTests (scenario empty state without the sheet\n  completion), PremiumNavigationContractTests (sheet list).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/wi0bFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0xaEP/AiLzcPyHlqz9GEE8uOq\n4td1ukKoR3PurK9sHTrZKD4d4j6zK99eyZ0o6efZ+evVnGmG2gr30GzgsRFEKqDP\nKlyBOU2w+nWbKqP6s7DRvnU7lqOyjn6xnksosDx7LzNXvCYk8b1upU+fwVFt+l38\npM2xgT3sRgcC2iH/Og1D4xgsuFMx0KNhAS2gYzdX+wI3jUfuddq/FN4ocYrd908u\npgOELtB8bz8XT6cQWwbskYBT/cXe2ZYTmNneaoH/QHC8mq6myb8xfNgU9G2K4GSE\nb4WCNFtgvnnhZeotyfpjVey0WlMclI6RS9Ig59yjplu6DiusRp8FiosjzMInZpnY\n/+XkTUgJptps/5ZNF2IgvJenwDuPkSJ233EHhlx3r9PuGpVOJ4pj7hKQJq3s0BWX\n3QpbieYJgxH1UgkE2xP2wmvV7OQD6BpYZzRl8g/YbsirXFZl0LbRZAn/kTcDqG5i\nmJp/Nk/J3Sk2IvmbIqyr3vCrKoKydpVg3ChCf6aVRHIxmaQwnHNCk5np5uGCVGh/\nDTwt7hxv5R6zl1mbbRj7bG1zG3+XndLxXtmM2Pq02lrVkjhPn02/ieu0nzORyD65\nAvmq1Pqi9YIqjDREGwbY05Cy84M3DqWi7cFFOJ5oELQwv4k9eAoIgyPs9ccwnaNq\nTZBjA7hHoZcJAIQTQJ3lECpH\n=grM1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T