_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/66a03f4ce7687c8e9dba8f9b5b67f9adc630ebe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:34:09Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:34:09Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"refactor(ios): remove the legacy event detail and invitation canvas\n\nThe event hub is the only event surface since the shell switch. Removes\nthe unreachable legacy detail and everything only it used:\n- EventDetailView and its private helpers (readiness, anticipation, AI\n  suggestion panel, metadata/participant/message previews,\n  EventPreviewDetailRow, OrganizerChip...) and the dead `else if`\n  branch of `.eventDetail` in AuthenticatedView;\n- EventDetailInvitationCanvas.swift (canvas, mappers, QA host) and the\n  `--wakeve-qa-invitation-canvas` DEBUG root in iOSApp;\n- EventNextAction;\n- the wakeveAccessibilityReduceTransparencyOverride environment value,\n  its QA state and the `--wakeve-qa-reduce-transparency` argument;\n- the EventWeatherMapCard view and EventWeatherViewModel\n  (EventWeatherSummary/EventWeatherPlace move to Models/EventWeather.swift,\n  still used by EventWeatherProvider and the scenario comparison);\n- the write-only preparedCreationChecklists state;\n- the dead OrganizationUXLabels marker enum.\nEventDetailViewModel is kept (event deletion from Information).\n\nDeleted tests (they only pinned removed code):\n- EventDetailInvitationCanvasContractTests (35 of 36 tests; the shared\n  artwork renderer test is re-anchored, see below) - canvas removed:\n  testMapperProjectsEveryLifecycleAccessPairToOneExpectedModeAndAction,\n  testMapperProjectsDraftAndPollingSubconditionsDeterministically,\n  testMapperFallsBackToShowDetailsWhenAuthorizedActionIsUnavailable,\n  testFinalizedMapperRejectsEveryMutatingAction,\n  testOrganizingActionFailsClosedWithoutAvailableReadinessData,\n  testMapperFiltersPrivateParticipantResponsibilityAndShareDataByAccess,\n  testParticipantSnapshotReconcilesCountsWithTheSameIdentitySnapshot,\n  testPendingSyncNeverProjectsAsSyncedAndPreservesItsTypedSubject,\n  testFinalizedPresentationHidesAIAndKeepsReadableDetails,\n  testFinalizedReadableSectionsConsumeExplicitReadOnlyInteractionPolicy,\n  testFinalizedMenuUsesReadOnlyPolicyAndKeepsOnlyReportAndSupport,\n  testFinalizedDetailsActionsScrollLocallyWithoutOpeningMutableRoutes,\n  testPresentationProjectionCoversEveryLifecycleAccessPairAndExclusiveMode,\n  testCanvasActionsAreTypedNavigationRequestsWithShowDetailsFallback,\n  testFinalizedActionPolicyIsExplicitlyReadOnly,\n  testInvitationCanvasShareConsumesOnlyTypedServerIssuedCapability,\n  testInvitationCanvasLeadsEventDetailAndExistingSectionsRemainProgressive,\n  testInvitationLandingIsInformationalAndDoesNotCompeteWithCanvasAction,\n  testEventDetailConsumesPureContextProjectionInsteadOfDecidingAccessAndActions,\n  testVoteSubmissionRequiresVotesForEveryProposedSlot,\n  testProductionShareCallbackConsumesOpaquePayloadWithoutLegacyInvitationRouting,\n  testProductionDoesNotAdvertiseEditDraftWithoutARealEditRoute,\n  testOneActionIdentityUsesMutuallyExclusiveAdaptivePlacement,\n  testCanvasHonorsAccessibilityAndKeepsControlsAtNativeHitTargets,\n  testPersistentActionAndShareLoaderUseOpaqueAccessibilityFallbacks,\n  testContextSyncUsesHonestEventAndParticipantResponseSubjects,\n  testCanvasConstrainsNarrowContentAndAdaptsDateLifecycleLayout,\n  testHeroCropAndFocalPointComeFromTheTotalArtworkAggregate,\n  testCanvasReceivesFiniteViewportWidthWithoutFixingDynamicTypeHeight,\n  testConfirmedParticipantBadgeIncludesACheckmarkAndPendingRemainsDistinct,\n  testAnnecyQAFixtureExercisesMenuChromeWithAnAbbreviatedDate,\n  testAnnecyQAHostScrollsVerticallyWithoutFixingAccessibilityHeight,\n  testAnnecyQAScrollContainerOwnsSafeAreaCoverage,\n  testExplicitDebugLaunchArgumentDisplaysExactAnnecyCanvasFixtureAndPreservesContentView,\n  testEveryCanvasLocalizationKeyExistsInEachSupportedLocale.\n- EventWeatherMapCardContractTests (4 of 6; 2 re-anchored):\n  testWeatherCardPreviewsCoverRequiredStates,\n  testWeatherCardStaleStateIsExplicitlyVisible,\n  testWeatherCardPreviewLocalizationKeysExistInCoreLocales,\n  testWeatherDesignValidationCoversA11yAndAppearanceModes - card removed.\n- PremiumEventDetailContractTests (10): testEventDetailUsesPremiumHierarchy,\n  testEventDetailUsesProgressiveSectionsAndCompactMessages,\n  testEventDetailPreservesBusinessLogicBoundary,\n  testEventDetailWeatherFollowsOrganizationAccessControl,\n  testEventDetailSurfacesAnticipationAndCountdown,\n  testInviteDeepLinkShowsGuestLandingStateOnEventDetail,\n  testEventDetailSurfacesGroupReadinessBeforeFinalization,\n  testEventDetailControlCopyUsesLocalizationKeys,\n  testEventDetailDatesUseUserLocale - EventDetailView removed;\n  testEventActionCopyIsLocalizedInCoreLocales - pinned the\n  events.next_action.* keys only EventNextAction used.\n- InvitationExperienceDesignerFindingsRedTests (6):\n  testEventDetailAdaptsScrimAndStateBadgesForHighContrastArtwork,\n  testReduceTransparencySelectsAnOpaqueCanvasScrimThatDiffersFromGlass,\n  testEventDetailMakesOnlyArtworkAndScrimFullBleedAboveSafeChrome,\n  testEventDetailKeepsInteractiveChromeInsideTheTopSafeArea,\n  testEventDetailInjectsTotalRepositoryArtworkIntoTheSharedCanvasRenderer,\n  testDetailSyncStateOwnsAnOpaqueContrastPlateInsteadOfUsingColorAlone\n  - canvas / reduce-transparency QA override removed.\n- InvitationExperienceSurfaceContractTests\n  .testCanvasReadyShareCapabilityRetainsAndRevalidatesEveryBindingDimension\n  - canvas share capability removed.\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testEventNextActionDoesNotBlockInvitationFirstPollsOnParticipants\n  - EventNextAction removed.\n- OrganizationPhase7ContractTests.testReadinessSectionsAndStateBadgesUseStableLocalizationKeys\n  - only satisfied by the dead OrganizationUXLabels marker enum.\n- WakeveAIContractTests.testCreatedEventDetailSeedsPreparedChecklistFromCreationContext,\n  .testEventDetailExposesReviewableAISuggestions,\n  .testEventDetailAIUsesCurrentUserLocale - detail AI panel removed.\n\nRe-anchored (behavior kept):\n- EventWeatherContractTests (new file): WeatherKit/MapKit use,\n  WeatherKit entitlement and privacy review, now on EventWeatherProvider\n  and ScenarioOrganizationView.\n- InvitationExperienceSurfaceContractTests: shared artwork renderer\n  (moved from the canvas tests), home open/edit draft through the typed\n  router (was canvas actions), surfaces list and forbidden-content scan\n  without the canvas.\n- OrganizationPhase5ContractTests: ORGANIZING Phase 5 entry points on the\n  hub modules. OrganizationPhase7ContractTests: payment/Tricount\n  readiness on the hub summaries; pending-sync copy on\n  sync.pending_changes; finalized transport access on\n  canAccessTransportPlanning(for:).\n- AllDaySlotAndGuestFinalizeTests: guest sign-in before finalizing on the\n  hub (signInToFinalize); ALL_DAY formatting kept for poll screens.\n- FindingsRegressionTests: report-event moderation on the hub menu.\n- QABlockersRegressionTests: lifecycle transitions through the hub.\n- PremiumDesignSystemContractTests: ContentView typography/motion without\n  the removed AI button.\n- ImmersiveWiringTests / EventDayWiringTests: slices no longer end on\n  removed markers (EventDayWiringTests was left broken by the previous\n  commit).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).","tree":{"sha":"b7488555c69b5c3147966ce9da512e0c917f1b73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/b7488555c69b5c3147966ce9da512e0c917f1b73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/66a03f4ce7687c8e9dba8f9b5b67f9adc630ebe3","verification":{"payload":"tree b7488555c69b5c3147966ce9da512e0c917f1b73\nparent 220fa9924ab44bb11eaaf033521180dc8eb0fea9\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790951649 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790951649 +0200\n\nrefactor(ios): remove the legacy event detail and invitation canvas\n\nThe event hub is the only event surface since the shell switch. Removes\nthe unreachable legacy detail and everything only it used:\n- EventDetailView and its private helpers (readiness, anticipation, AI\n  suggestion panel, metadata/participant/message previews,\n  EventPreviewDetailRow, OrganizerChip...) and the dead `else if`\n  branch of `.eventDetail` in AuthenticatedView;\n- EventDetailInvitationCanvas.swift (canvas, mappers, QA host) and the\n  `--wakeve-qa-invitation-canvas` DEBUG root in iOSApp;\n- EventNextAction;\n- the wakeveAccessibilityReduceTransparencyOverride environment value,\n  its QA state and the `--wakeve-qa-reduce-transparency` argument;\n- the EventWeatherMapCard view and EventWeatherViewModel\n  (EventWeatherSummary/EventWeatherPlace move to Models/EventWeather.swift,\n  still used by EventWeatherProvider and the scenario comparison);\n- the write-only preparedCreationChecklists state;\n- the dead OrganizationUXLabels marker enum.\nEventDetailViewModel is kept (event deletion from Information).\n\nDeleted tests (they only pinned removed code):\n- EventDetailInvitationCanvasContractTests (35 of 36 tests; the shared\n  artwork renderer test is re-anchored, see below) - canvas removed:\n  testMapperProjectsEveryLifecycleAccessPairToOneExpectedModeAndAction,\n  testMapperProjectsDraftAndPollingSubconditionsDeterministically,\n  testMapperFallsBackToShowDetailsWhenAuthorizedActionIsUnavailable,\n  testFinalizedMapperRejectsEveryMutatingAction,\n  testOrganizingActionFailsClosedWithoutAvailableReadinessData,\n  testMapperFiltersPrivateParticipantResponsibilityAndShareDataByAccess,\n  testParticipantSnapshotReconcilesCountsWithTheSameIdentitySnapshot,\n  testPendingSyncNeverProjectsAsSyncedAndPreservesItsTypedSubject,\n  testFinalizedPresentationHidesAIAndKeepsReadableDetails,\n  testFinalizedReadableSectionsConsumeExplicitReadOnlyInteractionPolicy,\n  testFinalizedMenuUsesReadOnlyPolicyAndKeepsOnlyReportAndSupport,\n  testFinalizedDetailsActionsScrollLocallyWithoutOpeningMutableRoutes,\n  testPresentationProjectionCoversEveryLifecycleAccessPairAndExclusiveMode,\n  testCanvasActionsAreTypedNavigationRequestsWithShowDetailsFallback,\n  testFinalizedActionPolicyIsExplicitlyReadOnly,\n  testInvitationCanvasShareConsumesOnlyTypedServerIssuedCapability,\n  testInvitationCanvasLeadsEventDetailAndExistingSectionsRemainProgressive,\n  testInvitationLandingIsInformationalAndDoesNotCompeteWithCanvasAction,\n  testEventDetailConsumesPureContextProjectionInsteadOfDecidingAccessAndActions,\n  testVoteSubmissionRequiresVotesForEveryProposedSlot,\n  testProductionShareCallbackConsumesOpaquePayloadWithoutLegacyInvitationRouting,\n  testProductionDoesNotAdvertiseEditDraftWithoutARealEditRoute,\n  testOneActionIdentityUsesMutuallyExclusiveAdaptivePlacement,\n  testCanvasHonorsAccessibilityAndKeepsControlsAtNativeHitTargets,\n  testPersistentActionAndShareLoaderUseOpaqueAccessibilityFallbacks,\n  testContextSyncUsesHonestEventAndParticipantResponseSubjects,\n  testCanvasConstrainsNarrowContentAndAdaptsDateLifecycleLayout,\n  testHeroCropAndFocalPointComeFromTheTotalArtworkAggregate,\n  testCanvasReceivesFiniteViewportWidthWithoutFixingDynamicTypeHeight,\n  testConfirmedParticipantBadgeIncludesACheckmarkAndPendingRemainsDistinct,\n  testAnnecyQAFixtureExercisesMenuChromeWithAnAbbreviatedDate,\n  testAnnecyQAHostScrollsVerticallyWithoutFixingAccessibilityHeight,\n  testAnnecyQAScrollContainerOwnsSafeAreaCoverage,\n  testExplicitDebugLaunchArgumentDisplaysExactAnnecyCanvasFixtureAndPreservesContentView,\n  testEveryCanvasLocalizationKeyExistsInEachSupportedLocale.\n- EventWeatherMapCardContractTests (4 of 6; 2 re-anchored):\n  testWeatherCardPreviewsCoverRequiredStates,\n  testWeatherCardStaleStateIsExplicitlyVisible,\n  testWeatherCardPreviewLocalizationKeysExistInCoreLocales,\n  testWeatherDesignValidationCoversA11yAndAppearanceModes - card removed.\n- PremiumEventDetailContractTests (10): testEventDetailUsesPremiumHierarchy,\n  testEventDetailUsesProgressiveSectionsAndCompactMessages,\n  testEventDetailPreservesBusinessLogicBoundary,\n  testEventDetailWeatherFollowsOrganizationAccessControl,\n  testEventDetailSurfacesAnticipationAndCountdown,\n  testInviteDeepLinkShowsGuestLandingStateOnEventDetail,\n  testEventDetailSurfacesGroupReadinessBeforeFinalization,\n  testEventDetailControlCopyUsesLocalizationKeys,\n  testEventDetailDatesUseUserLocale - EventDetailView removed;\n  testEventActionCopyIsLocalizedInCoreLocales - pinned the\n  events.next_action.* keys only EventNextAction used.\n- InvitationExperienceDesignerFindingsRedTests (6):\n  testEventDetailAdaptsScrimAndStateBadgesForHighContrastArtwork,\n  testReduceTransparencySelectsAnOpaqueCanvasScrimThatDiffersFromGlass,\n  testEventDetailMakesOnlyArtworkAndScrimFullBleedAboveSafeChrome,\n  testEventDetailKeepsInteractiveChromeInsideTheTopSafeArea,\n  testEventDetailInjectsTotalRepositoryArtworkIntoTheSharedCanvasRenderer,\n  testDetailSyncStateOwnsAnOpaqueContrastPlateInsteadOfUsingColorAlone\n  - canvas / reduce-transparency QA override removed.\n- InvitationExperienceSurfaceContractTests\n  .testCanvasReadyShareCapabilityRetainsAndRevalidatesEveryBindingDimension\n  - canvas share capability removed.\n- FindingsRegressionTests.testEventNextActionDoesNotBlockInvitationFirstPollsOnParticipants\n  - EventNextAction removed.\n- OrganizationPhase7ContractTests.testReadinessSectionsAndStateBadgesUseStableLocalizationKeys\n  - only satisfied by the dead OrganizationUXLabels marker enum.\n- WakeveAIContractTests.testCreatedEventDetailSeedsPreparedChecklistFromCreationContext,\n  .testEventDetailExposesReviewableAISuggestions,\n  .testEventDetailAIUsesCurrentUserLocale - detail AI panel removed.\n\nRe-anchored (behavior kept):\n- EventWeatherContractTests (new file): WeatherKit/MapKit use,\n  WeatherKit entitlement and privacy review, now on EventWeatherProvider\n  and ScenarioOrganizationView.\n- InvitationExperienceSurfaceContractTests: shared artwork renderer\n  (moved from the canvas tests), home open/edit draft through the typed\n  router (was canvas actions), surfaces list and forbidden-content scan\n  without the canvas.\n- OrganizationPhase5ContractTests: ORGANIZING Phase 5 entry points on the\n  hub modules. OrganizationPhase7ContractTests: payment/Tricount\n  readiness on the hub summaries; pending-sync copy on\n  sync.pending_changes; finalized transport access on\n  canAccessTransportPlanning(for:).\n- AllDaySlotAndGuestFinalizeTests: guest sign-in before finalizing on the\n  hub (signInToFinalize); ALL_DAY formatting kept for poll screens.\n- FindingsRegressionTests: report-event moderation on the hub menu.\n- QABlockersRegressionTests: lifecycle transitions through the hub.\n- PremiumDesignSystemContractTests: ContentView typography/motion without\n  the removed AI button.\n- ImmersiveWiringTests / EventDayWiringTests: slices no longer end on\n  removed markers (EventDayWiringTests was left broken by the previous\n  commit).\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/wOEbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0iAMP/j3/rVjzpwLHaRgmw7+j\n+a+U9Ezm1nS9D8KYl4uEuw9K4KhzmiRHJYG9a09sFyOFZ17M3GasWJ5q1rDn8GtT\nWxiS6eQSpSq1D+9nz0u0V2s20c6hWvwBsjRmfe8Q0GHy/iMdu9QaxIHC19fieQFH\npXRdgwsrvwL2Hw4d8Iy1Me2uk4EY2ogoZVS4PuUDB82VdpjDlMVS1okcwzMCjCkg\noG47xHlAl6XBZZx