ory,\nScenarioFactory) and the legacy Inbox (InboxView, InboxDetailView,\nInboxViewModel, InboxItemFactory).\n\nMoves kept types into their own files: InvitationArtworkView,\nInvitationAccessibilityIdentifier, EventScenario (Models/Create).\n\nDeleted tests (they only pinned removed code):\n- InboxViewModelTests (8 tests): testInitialState,\n  testMarkAsRead_updatesUnreadCount, testMarkAllAsRead_marksAllItems,\n  testDeleteNotification_removesFromList,\n  testDeleteNotification_updatesUnreadCount,\n  testInboxItemModel_requiresAction, testInboxItemModel_icons,\n  testInboxItemModel_hashableAndEquatable - legacy InboxViewModel removed.\n- PremiumMessagesContractTests (9 tests):\n  testMessagesUseEventConversationHierarchy,\n  testMessagesExposeSearchUnreadAndEventContext,\n  testMessagesExposeCoordinationOverviewFilters,\n  testMessagesContentRowsUseSemanticBrandLayer,\n  testMessagesPreserveInboxModelAndViewModelBoundary,\n  testMessageDetailUsesRealConversationAndExternalGroupHandoff,\n  testMessageDetailSurfacesDecisionSnapshotFromConversationItems,\n  testMessageDetailDoesNotRenderMockPollOrStatusState,\n  testInboxSelectionToolbarUsesLocalizedCopy - InboxView/InboxDetailView\n  removed.\n- PremiumDesignSystemContractTests.testInboxDetailMeetsTypographyMotionAndControlAccessibilityBudgets\n  - InboxDetailView removed.\n- PremiumEventDetailContractTests.testLegacyEventCardCopyUsesLocalizationKeys\n  - EventCard removed.\n- InvitationExperienceDesignerFindingsRedTests\n  .testLibraryFiltersWrapWithoutHorizontalClippingAndKeepTheActiveChoiceVisible,\n  .testLibraryPrimaryActionKeepsExplicitForegroundInDarkAndIncreasedContrast\n  - EventLibraryView removed.\n- InvitationExperienceRuntimeSurfaceTests\n  .testLibraryRendersAllFiveInteractiveRepositoryProjections,\n  .testLibraryFilterTitlesResolveLocalizedCopyInsteadOfShowingLocalizationKeys,\n  .testAuthenticatedRootInstallsTheInvitationLibraryInsteadOfOnlyLegacyHome\n  - EventLibraryView removed (3 of the 5 known pre-existing failures).\n- InvitationExperienceSurfaceContractTests.testLibraryRendersTypedArtworkAndKeepsCancellableFailureState\n  - EventLibraryView removed.\n- PremiumNavigationContractTests.testWakeveTabsAreDestinationOnly,\n  .testWakeveTabsDoNotExposeCreateEventAsDestination,\n  .testContentViewUsesProfileAsTabDestination - WakeveTab removed;\n  rewritten as testShellZonesAreDestinationOnly and\n  testContentViewPresentsProfileFromTheShellRouter.\n\nRe-anchored (behavior kept, anchors moved off removed code):\nInvitationExperienceDesignerFindingsRedTests (archive chrome, shared\nartwork renderer, archive refresh copy), ActivityShellWiringTests,\nBackgroundCoverageContractTests, EventDetailInvitationCanvasContractTests,\nFindingsRegressionTests, InvitationExperienceArchitectureReviewRedTests,\nInvitationExperienceLocalizationRedTests, InvitationExperienceQALaunchRedTests,\nOrganizationPhase5/7ContractTests, ParityRouteInventoryContractTests,\nRedesignShellTests, TransportPlanningContractTests, WakeveAIContractTests.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).","tree":{"sha":"ac3158eea2313359fa491f2daaad297954a91fef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/ac3158eea2313359fa491f2daaad297954a91fef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/220fa9924ab44bb11eaaf033521180dc8eb0fea9","verification":{"payload":"tree ac3158eea2313359fa491f2daaad297954a91fef\nparent f6765b5d9c302264e3bf99fbcee87dfb9300dc70\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790950242 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790950242 +0200\n\nrefactor(ios): remove the legacy tab shell, home, library, explore and inbox\n\nRemoves code made unreachable by the redesign shell switch: the legacy\ntab chrome (legacyTabChrome, tabContent(for:), tabBarVisibility,\nWakeveTab, selectedTab, unreadInboxCount), the AppView cases .inbox,\n.notifications, .notificationPreferences and .settings (now presented by\nthe shell router), EventListView/EventCard/EventListViewM