url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/f6765b5d9c302264e3bf99fbcee87dfb9300dc70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:11:13Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:11:13Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"feat(ios)!: make the redesign the only app shell\n\nThe 2026 redesign (zones Events/Activity, hub, home, create flow, event day)\nis now the iOS app unconditionally:\n- remove the iosRedesign2026 flag (FeatureFlags, @AppStorage, the two\n  onChange resets) and every flag-off branch in AuthenticatedView;\n- AppRouter.preRoute(_:router:) always applies the shell plan;\n- the wakeve://event/create deep link follows the + route\n  (beginRedesignEventCreation: create flow, or studio under the invitation\n  rollout); CreateFlowEntry.newEventRoute(invitationRollout:) loses\n  .legacySheet;\n- wakeve://leaderboard no longer traps the user: RedesignBackRoute maps\n  .leaderboard to .eventList (inset back button);\n- the legacy EventDetailView call site and CreateEventSheet cover stay in\n  place (unreachable) until pass B removes them.\n\nTests:\n- deleted FeatureFlagsTests (3 tests: testRedesignFlagIsOffByDefault,\n  testRedesignFlagReadsItsKey, testRedesignKeyIsStable) - the flag is gone;\n- deleted RedesignShellTests.testFlippingTheFlagResetsTheShellRouter - no\n  flag to flip;\n- deleted AppRouterTests.testPreRouteLeavesRoutesAndRouterUntouchedWhenRedesignIsOff\n  - the flag-off pass-through no longer exists;\n- re-anchored RedesignShellTests (unconditional shell, preRoute without flag,\n  home root, hub-only detail, leaderboard back route added), AppRouterTests,\n  ActivityShellWiringTests (preRoute filter without the flag-off half),\n  ImmersiveWiringTests, HubModuleSheetViewTests, CreateEventFlowWiringTests\n  and InvitationExperienceArchitectureReviewRedTests (create deep link\n  follows the + route).\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: iOS legacy tab shell removed; iosRedesign2026 flag removed.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).","tree":{"sha":"c9a95522bebe83933a4d1765a5d099cbb2cc4929","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/c9a95522bebe83933a4d1765a5d099cbb2cc4929"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/f6765b5d9c302264e3bf99fbcee87dfb9300dc70","verification":{"payload":"tree c9a95522bebe83933a4d1765a5d099cbb2cc4929\nparent 322138a02a2828250b92c59472b258d248e3d079\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790946673 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790946673 +0200\n\nfeat(ios)!: make the redesign the only app shell\n\nThe 2026 redesign (zones Events/Activity, hub, home, create flow, event day)\nis now the iOS app unconditionally:\n- remove the iosRedesign2026 flag (FeatureFlags, @AppStorage, the two\n  onChange resets) and every flag-off branch in AuthenticatedView;\n- AppRouter.preRoute(_:router:) always applies the shell plan;\n- the wakeve://event/create deep link follows the + route\n  (beginRedesignEventCreation: create flow, or studio under the invitation\n  rollout); CreateFlowEntry.newEventRoute(invitationRollout:) loses\n  .legacySheet;\n- wakeve://leaderboard no longer traps the user: RedesignBackRoute maps\n  .leaderboard to .eventList (inset back button);\n- the legacy EventDetailView call site and CreateEventSheet cover stay in\n  place (unreachable) until pass B removes them.\n\nTests:\n- deleted FeatureFlagsTests (3 tests: testRedesignFlagIsOffByDefault,\n  testRedesignFlagReadsItsKey, testRedesignKeyIsStable) - the flag is gone;\n- deleted RedesignShellTests.testFlippingTheFlagResetsTheShellRouter - no\n  flag to flip;\n- deleted AppRouterTests.testPreRouteLeavesRoutesAndRouterUntouchedWhenRedesignIsOff\n  - the flag-off pass-through no longer exists;\n- re-anchored RedesignShellTests (unconditional shell, preRoute without flag,\n  home root, hub-only detail, leaderboard back route added), AppRouterTests,\n  ActivityShellWiringTests (preRoute filter without the flag-off half),\n  ImmersiveWiringTests, HubModuleSheetViewTests, CreateEventFlowWiringTests\n  and InvitationExperienceArchitectureReviewRedTests (create deep link\n  follows the + route).\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: iOS legacy tab shell removed; iosRedesign2026 flag removed.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 9).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq/rXEbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0kPcP/1ifXPOmcEC0AoMbcxCM\nXdYwOKYHPpSuUixbC//5zfllgo2KHh7KtbNobRgxHUrAhE5prE1qQ8OJQKzp1OBQ\nwhaNBbwLqCJ6TrB0wBoKIH3A08e4uPnw5KhPN+4wm6My5f/ggQWQ7Idi7xxOlJ6A\ncDgkf/ihQFFOVgXuwtSqD6beaxlRAZxR/FHEYwhFxtqkfB6ZvIPFKPx7XUy0PYPO\nbTRL/+eznva4BoIhxT7hKZf62ZRkLnLiubk630Mvo1s7JazvJVEvZ772IE9NR4tD\ncgZNgFO2dJvadMAAP7hcOzwoc/3e0aiUA5DTQOSqW3ah2f2Y90W4Iqe7+sBmjrcr\nskcl8tGUihc1xk3PROOC6tWrwWsW1bKMQbKUtwQZ7xiT9lIEHqw2fmB4He7/bqDT\n0IoHJilXSWQOKUVKLtflWMxiUlNKBATeJTj+7WOYFWsea+LoRJlc8UXTm/Y67qYl\nnsksK6YS5Usdzs2axrsiHn0oiMMBeznqXGhO5wYprus8H+gcRnMBBrEqUGfxDw2b\nuS8idG0OnDcnIMsria+MPsPK0AjhOLBQDeJkitUcGuNTJMD7ZsNt+wp7NzEtLd8Y\nTnQ6cwMgW0lPUgo705dSkaFATqwNJqU/Jou+CjMkZHv+65ahuoZewX0MV4c0Q812\nLm54CnghKEwj/BY0YocPkKgL\n=D+T/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified