:"https://github.com/guyghost","id":213461,"login":"guyghost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/commits/f6d940abd8d56865c15a0bbaffcbf8c9df50115e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T19:26:46Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T19:26:46Z","email":"guyghost@gmail.com","name":"Guy MANDINA"},"message":"feat(ios): open participants in a summary sheet\n\nThe hub Guests tile (never locked) opens a WKModuleSheet: confirmed, pending\nand declined sections with avatar and name, the organizer marked, a \"N\nconfirmed\" pill and the pending count or \"nobody invited\" sentence. Same\nrecords and rule as the tile (getParticipantRecords, ParticipantAccessMapper).\nThe organizer of a non-finalized event gets Invite; everyone else gets Full\nscreen. Both follow addParticipantsRoute, so the invitations flag still picks\nparticipant management (off) or the invitation audience (on); the sheet\nlifecycle now carries hub routes as fallbacks.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 5c).","tree":{"sha":"58695555258847f2b1b53af8ae8fcd78a0ad1cb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/trees/58695555258847f2b1b53af8ae8fcd78a0ad1cb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guyghost/wakeve/git/commits/f6d940abd8d56865c15a0bbaffcbf8c9df50115e","verification":{"payload":"tree 58695555258847f2b1b53af8ae8fcd78a0ad1cb1\nparent 0a6ee228759c5b6041857299fb2471092249c3a4\nauthor Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790882806 +0200\ncommitter Guy MANDINA <guyghost@gmail.com> 1790882806 +0200\n\nfeat(ios): open participants in a summary sheet\n\nThe hub Guests tile (never locked) opens a WKModuleSheet: confirmed, pending\nand declined sections with avatar and name, the organizer marked, a \"N\nconfirmed\" pill and the pending count or \"nobody invited\" sentence. Same\nrecords and rule as the tile (getParticipantRecords, ParticipantAccessMapper).\nThe organizer of a non-finalized event gets Invite; everyone else gets Full\nscreen. Both follow addParticipantsRoute, so the invitations flag still picks\nparticipant management (off) or the invitation audience (on); the sheet\nlifecycle now carries hub routes as fallbacks.\n\nRefs Swarm DAO #47 (layer 5c).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEETEqlVEeZNKtOtBe951dUiAa843QFAmq+s/YbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEOdXVIgGvON0BmQP/1vWxL6IEj2ijX+b4a+s\nZJgCSbARyl1HPvDVlM0V36riz+UUnPVH5XArdSq36ckqLvXKBJQ30k5XUywLikD1\nbw2FPy8FpLS9ZBOWQVeJutAjDH/FDgH8YqSw5CRDrSZ24ttALcS/jBqRsZuLMW1I\n/ST9eQcWcj/al1tvIUswrdp9g/9+d1bflJs2h0tf8JID7xI1pTkzC8aGq2GpWElY\n4x2BGeb44CZ5HThm5eGPyH+ONItPndwgm1IOhkqreK5o2Wty/Vw0Y4z6kJ+TSwb7\nFXr3dejNGbwNa3unIbE4EukdfoST+LZnHzlV/6PxQhXBjVInLHwsNlbtyb+VVt2L\nfRhfEcWFEwl2xIhkXRL+VvsSD/nWddYMcX92M2m6UCn1ev228P12VrcZ0zsRWSN5\nNTgn5Rr2AR+Cbe4TAthetLvizoX67SIzAHWN5TH3fZ2kkCjIbUEgWbJLH0bxQ4i+\n3UKA0k8iR9ug1lp9gNTokB2tAZVmRxFqxnJSQjTABI/0HXwMo4gnGjDUOIqSQrbU\nL3/0aTZIh3qPyFyyxOkcxX4k9fQxSiNCUYeUuhUZefpJWIXZ+m7+5kxcZpylTLSD\nmb3QsXGQ7a23BXfh4Rz9tNupDQaNRcBIxDfk8S567ZBIXg+vMcRubkLjlhpR+qr0\nN+ODcDXZcrHtOxPHilp8+ugl\n=o42r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T09:08:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213461?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guyghost/followi