"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/63571d522c8b56037d494bdc82bffa8ac7e807b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T15:43:29Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T15:43:29Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"message":"Agregar video de demostración de la PoC funcionando en Android\n\nIncluye video demostrativo real de la aplicación ejecutándose en\ndispositivo Android con la nueva interfaz bancaria profesional.\n\nCambios:\n\n**Nuevo archivo:**\n- ✅ assets/videos/demo-android.mov (975KB)\n  - Grabación de pantalla Android\n  - Muestra comunicación bidireccional funcionando\n  - Interfaz bancaria con diseño profesional\n  - Formulario → Avatar horizontal alineado izquierda\n\n**Documentación actualizada:**\n\n1. **README.md**\n   - ✅ Agregada sección \"🎥 Demo en Video\"\n   - ✅ Actualizada tabla de contenidos\n   - ✅ Ubicada después de \"Principios de Diseño\"\n   - ✅ Lista de características visibles en el video\n   - ✅ Metadata: dispositivo, fecha, versión\n\n2. **PROJECT_CONTEXT.md**\n   - ✅ Agregada referencia al video antes de \"Inicio Rápido\"\n   - ✅ Link directo al archivo de video\n\n**Contenido del video:**\n1. Aplicación Flutter cargando Angular en WebView\n2. Interfaz bancaria con fondo blanco profesional\n3. Status badge mostrando conexión activa\n4. Formulario de actualización (arriba)\n5. Avatar + nombre usuario (abajo, horizontal)\n6. Actualización de nombre en tiempo real\n7. Comunicación Flutter ↔ Angular funcionando\n\n**Beneficios:**\n- 👁️ Los nuevos desarrolladores pueden ver la PoC funcionando\n- 📱 Evidencia del funcionamiento en dispositivo real\n- 🎨 Muestra la nueva interfaz bancaria profesional\n- ✅ Prueba de concepto validada visualmente\n\n**Ubicación:** `assets/videos/demo-android.mov`\n**Formato:** MOV (QuickTime)\n**Tamaño:** 975KB\n**Fecha:** 2025-11-17\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad9e73dfe8949e9449f14bf7646c44443326da53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/trees/ad9e73dfe8949e9449f14bf7646c44443326da53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/commits/63571d522c8b56037d494bdc82bffa8ac7e807b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":"juansuarez-pragma","node_id":"U_kgDOBrafUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commit/63571d522c8b56037d494bdc82bffa8ac7e807b1","node_id":"C_kwDOQT-BS9oAKDYzNTcxZDUyMmM4YjU2MDM3ZDQ5NGJkYzgyYmZmYThhYzdlODA3YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commit/5ca609dcb3392b43af0f86de6fa7f982f77cbb71","sha":"5ca609dcb3392b43af0f86de6fa7f982f77cbb71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/5ca609dcb3392b43af0f86de6fa7f982f77cbb71"}],"sha":"63571d522c8b56037d494bdc82bffa8ac7e807b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/63571d522c8b56037d494bdc82bffa8ac7e807b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":"juansuarez-pragma","node_id":"U_kgDOBrafUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/5ca609dcb3392b43af0f86de6fa7f982f77cbb71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T15:40:07Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T15:40:07Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"message":"Reorganizar layout: formulario primero, resultado después, alineación izquierda\n\nCambios de UX para mejorar el flujo lógico del formulario bancario.\n\nCambios principales:\n\n**Reorganización del Layout (HTML):**\n1. ✅ Formulario de actualización ahora está PRIMERO (arriba)\n   - Sección \"Actualizar Nombre\" con título\n   - Input de nombre completo\n   - Botón de actualizar\n\n2. ✅ Resultado del usuario ahora está SEGUNDO (abajo)\n   - Avatar + información del usuario\n   - Formato horizontal (avatar izq, texto der)\n\n**Alineación (CSS):**\n- ✅ Avatar section cambió de centrado a alineación izquierda\n- ✅ Layout horizontal para avatar y datos del usuario\n- ✅ Avatar más pequeño (64px) para no dominar visualmente\n- ✅ Información del usuario en layout de fila (flexbox)\n\n**Mejoras de UX:**\n- 📝 Flujo lógico: Primero ingresas datos, luego ves el resultado\n- 👁️ Alineación izquierda es más fácil de escanear\n- 🎯 Avatar horizontal ocupa menos espacio vertical\n- 📋 Sección con título claro \"Actualizar Nombre\"\n\n**Antes:**\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│    [Avatar grande]  │ ← Centrado\n│    Juan Perez       │\n│  NOMBRE DE USUARIO  │\n│  ─────────────────  │\n│                     │\n│  Actualizar nombre  │\n│  [Input]            │\n│  [Botón]            │\n└─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Después:**\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│ Actualizar Nombre   │ ← Título\n│ Nombre completo*    │\n│ [Input]             │\n│ [ACTUALIZAR]        │\n│ ─────────────────── │\n│ [A] Usuario actual  │ ← Horizontal\n│ [A] Juan Perez      │ ← Alineado izq\n└─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Beneficios:**\n1. Flujo más intuitivo (input → resultado)\n2. Mejor aprovechamiento del espacio vertical\n3. Alineación izquierda facilita lectura\n4. Avatar más discreto en su rol de indicador\n5. Título de sección mejora la navegación\n\nIdeal para formularios bancarios donde el enfoque debe estar en la acción (actualizar) antes que en el resultado (nombre actual).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23231dc085986ec893d3411c0deb1f9300403ebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/trees/23231dc085986ec893d3411c0deb1f9300403ebf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/commits/5ca609dcb3392b43af0f86de6fa7f982f77cbb71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":"juansuarez-pragma","node_id":"U_kgDOBrafUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commit/5ca609dcb3392b43af0f86de6fa7f982f77cbb71","node_id":"C_kwDOQT-BS9oAKDVjYTYwOWRjYjMzOTJiNDNhZjBmODZkZTZmYTdmOTgyZjc3Y2JiNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commit/a78640081c308a32c12c7ad9337ef01f6c242f4a","sha":"a78640081c308a32c12c7ad9337ef01f6c242f4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/a78640081c308a32c12c7ad9337ef01f6c242f4a"}],"sha":"5ca609dcb3392b43af0f86de6fa7f982f77cbb71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/5ca609dcb3392b43af0f86de6fa7f982f77cbb71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":"juansuarez-pragma","node_id":"U_kgDOBrafUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/a78640081c308a32c12c7ad9337ef01f6c242f4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T15:30:07Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T15:30:07Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"message":"Transformar interfaz a diseño bancario corporativo profesional\n\nRediseño completo de la paleta de colores y estilo visual para\nalinearse con estándares bancarios y corporativos profesionales.\n\nCambios principales:\n\n**Paleta de Colores Corporativa:**\n- 🔵 Primario: Azul Corporativo (#003D82)\n- 🟢 Success: Verde Profesional (#00A651)\n- ⚪ Fondo: Blanco puro (#FFFFFF)\n- ⚫ Texto: Grises profesionales (#212121 - #757575)\n\n**Estilo Visual:**\n- ✅ Fondo blanco limpio (reemplaza gradiente purple-indigo)\n- ✅ Card con borde sutil gris (#E0E0E0)\n- ✅ Sombras más discretas y profesionales\n- ✅ Bordes más cuadrados (border-radius: 4px-8px)\n- ✅ Avatar azul corporativo sólido\n- ✅ Status badge con estilo sobrio\n- ✅ Tipografía más formal y seria\n\n**Mejoras Profesionales:**\n- 📝 Labels con asterisco obligatorio (*)\n- 🔲 Inputs con bordes rectos y focus azul corporativo\n- 🔘 Botón en mayúsculas con letter-spacing\n- 📊 Sombras sutiles y consistentes\n- ✨ Animación de entrada suave (fadeInUp)\n- ♿ Mejor accesibilidad con outlines claros\n\n**Características Bancarias:**\n1. **Formal y Serio:** Sin gradientes llamativos\n2. **Colores Corporativos:** Azul oscuro confiable\n3. **Espaciado Generoso:** Facilita lectura\n4. **Bordes Definidos:** Clara separación visual\n5. **Tipografía Legible:** Pesos y tamaños apropiados\n6. **Estados Claros:** Disabled, focus, hover bien definidos\n\n**Detalles de Diseño:**\n- Border-radius reducido de 12-24px a 4-8px\n- Sombras de 0.1-0.15 opacity a 0.08-0.16 opacity\n- Text-transform: uppercase en botones y labels\n- Letter-spacing aumentado para formalidad\n- Font-weights más conservadores\n\n**Resultado:**\nInterfaz que transmite:\n- ✅ Confianza\n- ✅ Profesionalismo\n- ✅ Seguridad\n- ✅ Seriedad\n- ✅ Corporativismo\n\nPerfecta para aplicaciones bancarias, financieras o corporativas.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"085a665e64cb1b7a0d5b3923d84d981702f90d49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/trees/085a665e64cb1b7a0d5b3923d84d981702f90d49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/commits/a78640081c308a32c12c7ad9337ef01f6c242f4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":"juansuarez-pragma","node_id":"U_kgDOBrafUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commit/a78640081c308a32c12c7ad9337ef01f6c242f4a","node_id":"C_kwDOQT-BS9oAKGE3ODY0MDA4MWMzMDhhMzJjMTJjN2FkOTMzN2VmMDFmNmMyNDJmNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commit/d386966202af746dd3e92b7e7cf13d1545c8f1de","sha":"d386966202af746dd3e92b7e7cf13d1545c8f1de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/d386966202af746dd3e92b7e7cf13d1545c8f1de"}],"sha":"a78640081c308a32c12c7ad9337ef01f6c242f4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/a78640081c308a32c12c7ad9337ef01f6c242f4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":"juansuarez-pragma","node_id":"U_kgDOBrafUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/commits/d386966202af746dd3e92b7e7cf13d1545c8f1de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T15:26:08Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T15:26:08Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"message":"Rediseñar interfaz Angular MFE con diseño minimalista y moderno\n\nSimplificación completa de la UI eliminando elementos innecesarios y\ncreando una experiencia más amigable y enfocada para el usuario.\n\nCambios principales:\n\n**HTML (app.component.html):**\n- ✅ Eliminadas 4 cards informativas (reducción de ~95 líneas)\n- ✅ Una sola card centrada con avatar y formulario\n- ✅ Avatar circular con iniciales del usuario\n- ✅ Status badge minimalista en esquina superior derecha\n- ✅ Footer simple y discreto\n- ✅ Reducción de 103 a 57 líneas (45% menos código)\n\n**TypeScript (app.component.ts):**\n- ✅ Agregado método getInitials() para generar iniciales del nombre\n- ✅ Lógica para manejar nombres de una o múltiples palabras\n- ✅ Fallback para estado de carga\n\n**CSS (app.component.css):**\n- ✅ Diseño completamente nuevo y minimalista\n- ✅ Paleta de colores moderna (Indigo/Purple gradient)\n- ✅ Fondo con gradiente llamativo pero elegante\n- ✅ Card flotante con sombras suaves y bordes redondeados\n- ✅ Avatar con gradiente y efecto hover\n- ✅ Animaciones suaves (fadeIn, pulse)\n- ✅ Status badge con dot animado que cambia de color\n- ✅ Inputs y botones con transiciones fluidas\n- ✅ Diseño responsivo para móviles\n- ✅ Mejoras de accesibilidad (focus states)\n\n**Beneficios:**\n1. **Menos es más:** Solo lo esencial, sin información técnica innecesaria\n2. **Enfoque claro:** Usuario puede actualizar su nombre de forma intuitiva\n3. **Diseño moderno:** Gradientes, sombras, animaciones sutiles\n4. **Mobile-first:** Optimizado para pantallas pequeñas\n5. **UX mejorada:** Feedback visual claro del estado de conexión\n6. **Accesibilidad:** Estados de focus y contraste adecuado\n\n**Resultado:**\n- Interfaz más amigable y profesional\n- Carga visual reducida significativamente\n- Experiencia de usuario mejorada\n- Diseño alineado con tendencias modernas de UI/UX\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"efcb42d6654b1116f1ebb1a6218d6467eabc2d67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/trees/efcb42d6654b1116f1ebb1a6218d6467eabc2d67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/commits/d386966202af746dd3e92b7e7cf13d1545c8f1de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":