ta web/ (~64KB)\n- Elimina carpeta windows/ (~116KB)\n- Actualiza .metadata para reflejar solo Android e iOS\n\nTotal liberado: ~544KB de código innecesario\n\nRazón: Esta PoC está diseñada exclusivamente para aplicaciones móviles\nnativas ya que flutter_inappwebview no funciona en plataformas desktop\nni web. Mantener estas carpetas genera confusión y aumenta el tamaño\ndel repositorio innecesariamente.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4ccab2676e6bb743f32cb81118f11239b5c355a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/trees/d4ccab2676e6bb743f32cb81118f11239b5c355a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/commits/d33cd0df49d05d362f2c6dbff917cbe600232a04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":"juansuarez-pragma","node_id":"U_kgDOBrafUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https