:01:38Z","email":"juan.suarez@pragma.com.co","name":"juancarlossuarezmarin"},"message":"Limitar alcance a plataformas móviles (Android/iOS)\n\nElimina referencias a Flutter Web y plataformas desktop (macOS, Windows, Linux) de la documentación para reflejar el alcance real de la PoC.\n\nCambios:\n- CLAUDE.md: Elimina comandos y ejemplos de Chrome y macOS\n- README.md: Actualiza tabla de plataformas soportadas\n- RUN_NOW.md: Enfoca guía en dispositivos móviles únicamente\n- PROJECT_CONTEXT.md: Actualiza sección de plataformas soportadas\n- QUICKSTART.md: Elimina ejemplos de Chrome y macOS\n\nLa PoC está diseñada exclusivamente para aplicaciones móviles nativas ya que flutter_inappwebview no funciona en web ni desktop.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35d040824be3bc042483e93b9312639d60e4e86e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/trees/35d040824be3bc042483e93b9312639d60e4e86e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juansuarez-pragma/angular-flutter/git/commits/30d559a39b04ad41b616a9be9c0fd8a094707849","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112631633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/juansuarez-pragma","id":112631633,"login":"juansuarez-pragma","node_id":"U_kgDOBrafUQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuarez-pragma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juansuar