egisb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shashank3778/Denali/commits/af7edd8a3fd31ece3d29d68112f45fd4ae62a1fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-02T10:48:48Z","email":"regis@behmo.com","name":"Régis Behmo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-14T16:53:56Z","email":"regis@behmo.com","name":"Régis Behmo"},"message":"chore: remove husky 🪓🐶\n\nWe remove husky, which is triggering pre-push git hooks, including\nrunning \"npm lint\". This is causing failures when building Docker\nimages, because \"npm clean-install --omit=dev\" automatically triggers \"npm\nprepare\", which attemps to run \"husky\". But husky is not listed in the\nbuild dependencies, only in devDependencies. As a consequence, package\ninstallation is failing with the following error:\n\n        14.13 > @edx/frontend-app-ora-grading@0.0.1 prepare\n        14.13 > husky install\n        14.13\n        14.15 sh: 1: husky: not found\n\nSimilar to: https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/pull/1622","tree":{"sha":"598f55888c344dc09c3e94b83f9e182157a95957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shashank3778/Denali/git/trees/598f55888c344dc09c3e94b83f9e182157a95957"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shashank3778/Denali/git/commits/af7edd8a3fd31ece3d29d68112f45fd4ae62a1fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44319?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb/followers","followin