16:30:20Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"message":"Update approval system to handle different approver types\n\nModify the PartB-Approval component to conditionally render approver selection based on the `isFromPartA` flag. This flag is now included in the `Approver` type and defaults to `true` when loading existing approver data from the database. New approvers added via the ''Add Approver'' button will have `isFromPartA` set to `false`. The `useExternalUsers` hook is integrated to populate the approver selection dropdown for non-Part A approvers.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 6db3846d-75f6-4a8b-8162-ab641d1c7f9c\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: b57ce70b-d3e3-4527-b0a5-733a53da4888\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"e2deb75be27f7a394aa7ab36d224cc0b76b75a03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/e2deb75be27f7a394aa7ab36d224cc0b76b75a03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/a5fb35fdb74a3be16863d4e0717ced99f2b9f4fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/a5fb35fdb74a3be16863d4e0717ced99f2b9f4fe","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKGE1ZmIzNWZkYjc0YTNiZTE2ODYzZDRlMDcxN2NlZDk5ZjJiOWY0ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/75495b93ea8f8b8ac1ecc412897efe57abc450e7","sha":"75495b93ea8f8b8ac1ecc412897efe57abc450e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/75495b93ea8f8b8ac1ecc412897efe57abc450e7"}],"sha":"a5fb35fdb74a3be16863d4e0717ced99f2b9f4fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/a5fb35fdb74a3be16863d4e0717ced99f2b9f4fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/75495b93ea8f8b8ac1ecc4