Percent` instead of `minChecklistVerifications`. Adds normalization for legacy configurations to handle `null` and `undefined` values correctly, ensuring the UI displays \"Not configured\" appropriately. Updates the `PromotionReviewForm` and `PromotionFormEditor` components to reflect this change, including input validation and display of the percentage. Modifies the schema to include the new `minChecklistCompletionPercent` field with a default value of `null`.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 94988c10-dc9d-45a3-b8bf-8968a8efb494\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: b4649313-fe86-440b-a7d9-598c6990e743\nReplit-Helium-Checkpoint-Created: true","tree":{"sha":"18696412a89411ccf1bd090f6b0416aaf1dc3896","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/18696412a89411ccf1bd090f6b0416aaf1dc3896"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/0e08969701af4230e896af473c1618042a79a8b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/0e08969701af4230e896af473c1618042a79a8b1","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKDBlMDg5Njk3MDFhZjQyMzBlODk2YWY0NzNjMTYxODA0MmE3OWE4YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/d20f95b8b2605038f6d4242e99f5793be14cbd97","sha":"d20f95b8b2605038f6d4242e99f5793be14cbd97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/d20f95b8b2605038f6d4242e99f5793be14cbd97"}],"sha":"0e08969701af4230e896af473c1618042a79a8b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/0e08969701af4230e896af473c1618042a79a8b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/d20f95b8b2605038f6d4242e99f5793be14cbd97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-29T07:32:09Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","n